(2959930, 413732, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and nicely executed. Like the use of black and white.</td>', 'Interesting composition and nicely executed. Like the use of black and white.', '2006-10-25 03:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959937, 416512, 5792, '<td valign="top">Like the color and the idea behind this image. Having the centered flower in sharpest focus is a good idea.<br/> <br/>Soft focused foregrounds generally are not as pleasing as soft focused backgrounds. They tend to be more distracting. In your case the ''quality'' of the bokeh is better in the foreground than the background. However, that being said, I''d still consider cropping about 20% off the bottom even though the background bokeh is on the harsh side.</td>', 'Like the color and the idea behind this image. Having the centered flower in sharpest focus is a good idea. Soft focused foregrounds generally are not as pleasing as soft focused backgrounds. They tend to be more distracting. In your case the ''quality'' of the bokeh is better in the foreground than the background. However, that being said, I''d still consider cropping about 20% off the bottom even though the background bokeh is on the harsh side.', '2006-10-25 03:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959942, 417026, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and great take on the challenge theme. It doesn''t feature ''circles of confusion'' but the background bokeh provides ominous, if not pleasing, background bokeh that dramatically supports the main subject - despair. Black and white is perfect.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and great take on the challenge theme. It doesn''t feature ''circles of confusion'' but the background bokeh provides ominous, if not pleasing, background bokeh that dramatically supports the main subject - despair. Black and white is perfect.', '2006-10-25 03:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959960, 416046, 61318, '<td valign="top">way too much PP work here</td>', 'way too much PP work here', '2006-10-25 03:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959967, 416834, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautiful technical imagery. Superb sharpness. Great colors and your pleasing bokeh strongly supports your main subject. The border is a bit ostentatious but the photography is nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful technical imagery. Superb sharpness. Great colors and your pleasing bokeh strongly supports your main subject. The border is a bit ostentatious but the photography is nicely done.', '2006-10-25 03:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2959968, 416834, 66201, '<td valign="top">The framing is too heavy: I would have preferred this without: the blackness of the beetle is strong, but it is pulling towards the frame and so the general background gets lost in the battle between darknesses...</td>', 'The framing is too heavy: I would have preferred this without: the blackness of the beetle is strong, but it is pulling towards the frame and so the general background gets lost in the battle between darknesses...', '2006-10-25 03:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
