(2959996, 416832, 24613, '<td valign="top">Now this is true Bokeh - foreground and background out of focus.  You the man - or woman!!  10 for knowing what Bokeh really is!! :)</td>', 'Now this is true Bokeh - foreground and background out of focus.  You the man - or woman!!  10 for knowing what Bokeh really is!! :)', '2006-10-25 03:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
