(2960004, 416852, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Great use of circular bokeh supporting your main subject. You might consider cropping about 25% off the left side and about 12% off the bottom to offset the mini-pumpkin rather than leaving it centered and this will also better highlight the best part of your circular bokeh. This will give the composition a more eye pleasing look and balance the bokeh against the pumpkin.</td>', 'Beautifully done. Great use of circular bokeh supporting your main subject. You might consider cropping about 25% off the left side and about 12% off the bottom to offset the mini-pumpkin rather than leaving it centered and this will also better highlight the best part of your circular bokeh. This will give the composition a more eye pleasing look and balance the bokeh against the pumpkin.', '2006-10-25 03:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960005, 416920, 24613, '<td valign="top">A second true Bokeh photo!!!  I love people who know what they''re doing!! 10</td>', 'A second true Bokeh photo!!!  I love people who know what they''re doing!! 10', '2006-10-25 03:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960008, 415041, 26194, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice colors, tones and placement of subject in frame.</td>', 'Great shot. Nice colors, tones and placement of subject in frame.', '2006-10-25 03:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960030, 416993, 5792, '<td valign="top">Call me silly but when thinking of bokeh, images like this one are what comes to my mind. The bokeh makes the image. The technical quality of this photograph is top notch from composition to clarity. One of the best submissions to this challenge.</td>', 'Call me silly but when thinking of bokeh, images like this one are what comes to my mind. The bokeh makes the image. The technical quality of this photograph is top notch from composition to clarity. One of the best submissions to this challenge.', '2006-10-25 04:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960038, 415322, 5792, '<td valign="top">Birds and bugs (particularly butterflys) tend to score high in bokeh challenges. That will be true again in this one. The way your yellow background highlights the bird is a terrific example how bokeh can support the main subject. The bird is caught in wonderful pose.</td>', 'Birds and bugs (particularly butterflys) tend to score high in bokeh challenges. That will be true again in this one. The way your yellow background highlights the bird is a terrific example how bokeh can support the main subject. The bird is caught in wonderful pose.', '2006-10-25 04:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960056, 415948, 43434, '<td valign="top">Spanners .. interesting choice .. I only know of one person so far this fascinated by them .... but I love that you are using a new one for this picture makes it look great.</td>', 'Spanners .. interesting choice .. I only know of one person so far this fascinated by them .... but I love that you are using a new one for this picture makes it look great.', '2006-10-25 04:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960058, 414632, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you got the color of the "circles of confusion" but, it doesn''t seem to compliment the flower to me.  Idea and execution seem to be done very well just the colors keep me from putting it up higher.</td>', 'Not sure how you got the color of the "circles of confusion" but, it doesn''t seem to compliment the flower to me.  Idea and execution seem to be done very well just the colors keep me from putting it up higher.', '2006-10-25 04:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960063, 416856, 61318, '<td valign="top">gorgeous model and location...light might be a bit harsh</td>', 'gorgeous model and location...light might be a bit harsh', '2006-10-25 04:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960067, 414679, 66398, '<td valign="top">It took the title to help me see the shell.  Very nice bokeh. I think a brighter shell or maybe a different angle or more lighting on the shell might nudge the score up a bit more.  Something to make the shell stand out just a bit more that''s all.</td>', 'It took the title to help me see the shell.  Very nice bokeh. I think a brighter shell or maybe a different angle or more lighting on the shell might nudge the score up a bit more.  Something to make the shell stand out just a bit more that''s all.', '2006-10-25 04:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960068, 416106, 5792, '<td valign="top">Superb color, lighting and clarity. Nice capture of the lizard in a good pose position. You might consider cropping about 15% off the right side to remove the least intersting content in the composition and offset your main subject for greater viewer interest.</td>', 'Superb color, lighting and clarity. Nice capture of the lizard in a good pose position. You might consider cropping about 15% off the right side to remove the least intersting content in the composition and offset your main subject for greater viewer interest.', '2006-10-25 04:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960069, 414679, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing and beautiful circular bokeh. Would like to see more light on your shell and the edging on the sheel, particularly on the right side, looks artificial and is a distraction from an otherwise superb image.</td>', 'Very pleasing and beautiful circular bokeh. Would like to see more light on your shell and the edging on the sheel, particularly on the right side, looks artificial and is a distraction from an otherwise superb image.', '2006-10-25 04:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960071, 416217, 43434, '<td valign="top">The small picture does lose the impact of going for a full size allowable.</td>', 'The small picture does lose the impact of going for a full size allowable.', '2006-10-25 04:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960076, 416800, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great expression capture. Wonderful clarity in the eyes. You did a great job getting making it look as though your subject is looking up at the bokeh. That is a very clever idea. The soft focus of the arm and hand is a bit of a distraction but otherwise is a beautifully crafted image.</td>', 'Great expression capture. Wonderful clarity in the eyes. You did a great job getting making it look as though your subject is looking up at the bokeh. That is a very clever idea. The soft focus of the arm and hand is a bit of a distraction but otherwise is a beautifully crafted image.', '2006-10-25 04:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960080, 415270, 5792, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous portrait, nice smooth tones and the bokeh is like a rose clipped to your subject''s hair.</td>', 'Gorgeous portrait, nice smooth tones and the bokeh is like a rose clipped to your subject''s hair.', '2006-10-25 04:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960086, 415786, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is very nice with the composition, the colors, the contrast and the bokeh but, I think it would do better if the leaves were more sharply focused. One of my higher scores for this challenge.</td>', 'This is very nice with the composition, the colors, the contrast and the bokeh but, I think it would do better if the leaves were more sharply focused. One of my higher scores for this challenge.', '2006-10-25 04:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960087, 413761, 44728, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and colors, also the DOF works great on this one!<br/>Give this a 8</td>', 'Lovely composition and colors, also the DOF works great on this one!Give this a 8', '2006-10-25 04:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
