(2960093, 416046, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good color combinations and nicely composed. Considering this is a setup shot the ocean horizon should be level. Looks like you might have used Shadow/Highlight in Photoshop CS2 or some other contrast/lighting enhancing tool. The resulting halo around the lighthouse will be considered more distracting than enhancing by some voters.</td>', 'Good color combinations and nicely composed. Considering this is a setup shot the ocean horizon should be level. Looks like you might have used Shadow/Highlight in Photoshop CS2 or some other contrast/lighting enhancing tool. The resulting halo around the lighthouse will be considered more distracting than enhancing by some voters.', '2006-10-25 04:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960098, 415781, 26648, '<td valign="top">Great concept</td>', 'Great concept', '2006-10-25 04:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
