(2960946, 413456, 3102, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity!  As a football shooter myself, I''m impressed with the sharpness of this one.</td>', 'Excellent clarity!  As a football shooter myself, I''m impressed with the sharpness of this one.', '2006-10-25 10:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960952, 414628, 59148, '<td valign="top">too much in focus subject not isolated enough</td>', 'too much in focus subject not isolated enough', '2006-10-25 10:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960954, 415731, 59148, '<td valign="top">would have worked better if the zebra was not so dominant in the photo</td>', 'would have worked better if the zebra was not so dominant in the photo', '2006-10-25 10:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960957, 416349, 59148, '<td valign="top">been better in the wild</td>', 'been better in the wild', '2006-10-25 10:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960958, 415786, 65779, '<td valign="top">Out of focus subject and overbearing bokeh</td>', 'Out of focus subject and overbearing bokeh', '2006-10-25 10:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960959, 416919, 59148, '<td valign="top">sharper focus on the subject needed</td>', 'sharper focus on the subject needed', '2006-10-25 11:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960961, 414663, 59148, '<td valign="top">more like feed me!</td>', 'more like feed me!', '2006-10-25 11:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960963, 415997, 65779, '<td valign="top">Pleasing shot</td>', 'Pleasing shot', '2006-10-25 11:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960964, 416752, 59148, '<td valign="top">bokeh would require something to be in sharp focus. I do not see anythinh in focus</td>', 'bokeh would require something to be in sharp focus. I do not see anythinh in focus', '2006-10-25 11:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960971, 414168, 65779, '<td valign="top">Lovely stuff. 9</td>', 'Lovely stuff. 9', '2006-10-25 11:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960972, 416910, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid that the blurred portion is really only distracting in this instance.  There''s no clearly defined subject here, and I wouldn''t have known these were red leaves had it not been for the title.</td>', 'I''m afraid that the blurred portion is really only distracting in this instance.  There''s no clearly defined subject here, and I wouldn''t have known these were red leaves had it not been for the title.', '2006-10-25 11:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960973, 415546, 64175, '<td valign="top">The focus is sharp on the flower/wasp which is good. The bokeh is good and does help the photo.  The colors in subject matter itself is rather bland  IMO.  I wish there were something a little more vivid to give it some Wow factor. 6.</td>', 'The focus is sharp on the flower/wasp which is good. The bokeh is good and does help the photo.  The colors in subject matter itself is rather bland  IMO.  I wish there were something a little more vivid to give it some Wow factor. 6.', '2006-10-25 11:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960974, 416913, 59148, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but where is the bokeh?</td>', 'Nice photo but where is the bokeh?', '2006-10-25 11:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960977, 416169, 59148, '<td valign="top">finger kills it</td>', 'finger kills it', '2006-10-25 11:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960979, 415496, 64175, '<td valign="top">The entire photo is very yellowed.  The DOF is fairly deep as well so it really doesn''t give you a whole lot of bokeh enhancement IMO.</td>', 'The entire photo is very yellowed.  The DOF is fairly deep as well so it really doesn''t give you a whole lot of bokeh enhancement IMO.', '2006-10-25 11:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960981, 414780, 3102, '<td valign="top">Interesting vantage point and everything, but there''s no bokeh at all here, and it is a bokeh challenge...</td>', 'Interesting vantage point and everything, but there''s no bokeh at all here, and it is a bokeh challenge...', '2006-10-25 11:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960982, 416438, 59148, '<td valign="top">Must have something in focus to achieve bokeh</td>', 'Must have something in focus to achieve bokeh', '2006-10-25 11:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960983, 414171, 64175, '<td valign="top">Too much red tint in the photo for my taste and the glard one the middle of the label on the middle bottle is too harsh.</td>', 'Too much red tint in the photo for my taste and the glard one the middle of the label on the middle bottle is too harsh.', '2006-10-25 11:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960984, 413940, 65779, '<td valign="top">This works very well</td>', 'This works very well', '2006-10-25 11:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960994, 416925, 59148, '<td valign="top">too dark to really find any detail or focus on the shot</td>', 'too dark to really find any detail or focus on the shot', '2006-10-25 11:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2960996, 414732, 65779, '<td valign="top">Looks like a sickly dope leaf! :-)</td>', 'Looks like a sickly dope leaf! :-)', '2006-10-25 11:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961000, 415040, 64175, '<td valign="top">I think you needed to get even closer to the rock/subject to have the background be more out of focus.  The DOF is fairly deep in this photo IMO so it really doesn''t add a significant amount to the subject matter. 5.</td>', 'I think you needed to get even closer to the rock/subject to have the background be more out of focus.  The DOF is fairly deep in this photo IMO so it really doesn''t add a significant amount to the subject matter. 5.', '2006-10-25 11:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961004, 416774, 64175, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  And if anyone wants those bokeh circles, they certainly can''t say there wasn''t one here.  The bokeh truly enhances the image, thus fully meeting the challenge.  Good job.  10.</td>', 'Very nice.  And if anyone wants those bokeh circles, they certainly can''t say there wasn''t one here.  The bokeh truly enhances the image, thus fully meeting the challenge.  Good job.  10.', '2006-10-25 11:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961005, 416367, 59148, '<td valign="top">needs more oof on the background</td>', 'needs more oof on the background', '2006-10-25 11:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961013, 414814, 64175, '<td valign="top">The vertical bright yellow stripe on the right side takes from the nice subject matter rather than enhancing it IMO.</td>', 'The vertical bright yellow stripe on the right side takes from the nice subject matter rather than enhancing it IMO.', '2006-10-25 11:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961021, 413515, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid that bokeh and motion blur are not one in the same... :/</td>', 'I''m afraid that bokeh and motion blur are not one in the same... :/', '2006-10-25 11:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961030, 413979, 65779, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit too set up.</td>', 'This looks a bit too set up.', '2006-10-25 11:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961031, 415102, 64175, '<td valign="top">The contrast on the white is a bit much, it is almost glaring.  5.</td>', 'The contrast on the white is a bit much, it is almost glaring.  5.', '2006-10-25 11:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961034, 415067, 49480, '<td valign="top">Finally, someone who realizes that bokeh is out of focus highlights.  Good job.  Love the leaf.</td>', 'Finally, someone who realizes that bokeh is out of focus highlights.  Good job.  Love the leaf.', '2006-10-25 11:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961036, 413732, 65779, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but would have worked if the background was more lit and interesting.</td>', 'Nice idea but would have worked if the background was more lit and interesting.', '2006-10-25 11:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961040, 416888, 65779, '<td valign="top">Lovely stuff - perfect for the challenge. 9.</td>', 'Lovely stuff - perfect for the challenge. 9.', '2006-10-25 11:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961048, 415199, 64175, '<td valign="top">The subject itself is blurred at the edges which takes away from the nice use of DOF you have chosen.</td>', 'The subject itself is blurred at the edges which takes away from the nice use of DOF you have chosen.', '2006-10-25 11:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961049, 413786, 65779, '<td valign="top">Pity it was not frozen with faster shutter speed!</td>', 'Pity it was not frozen with faster shutter speed!', '2006-10-25 11:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961056, 416979, 15711, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm this has no bokeh. With an aperture setting around 2.4 - 3.0, you could have achieved it. It''s not a very interesting subject matter, but with a blurred bokeh background, it might have had more visual impact. I hope this helps. ;~D</td>', 'Hmmmm this has no bokeh. With an aperture setting around 2.4 - 3.0, you could have achieved it. It''s not a very interesting subject matter, but with a blurred bokeh background, it might have had more visual impact. I hope this helps. ;~D', '2006-10-25 11:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961060, 414628, 65779, '<td valign="top">Distracting border in this one.</td>', 'Distracting border in this one.', '2006-10-25 11:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961066, 414490, 64175, '<td valign="top">The windmill is not as shallow in the DOF as I would want for the bokeh to really add something.  If possible, getting a little closer zoom to the subject would have enhanced this. Perhaps closer on the head to midsection rather than the entire body if you were already at maximum zoom.</td>', 'The windmill is not as shallow in the DOF as I would want for the bokeh to really add something.  If possible, getting a little closer zoom to the subject would have enhanced this. Perhaps closer on the head to midsection rather than the entire body if you were already at maximum zoom.', '2006-10-25 11:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961067, 416149, 3102, '<td valign="top">Could be an excellent shot with a little more tweaking of the colors.  There seems to be a bit too much cyan in there, making the skin tones a bit unnatural.</td>', 'Could be an excellent shot with a little more tweaking of the colors.  There seems to be a bit too much cyan in there, making the skin tones a bit unnatural.', '2006-10-25 11:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961070, 416268, 64175, '<td valign="top">Most everything appears to be in foucs on this so I have a hard time with it meeting the challenge.  I really like the pattern and colors chosen in the composition.</td>', 'Most everything appears to be in foucs on this so I have a hard time with it meeting the challenge.  I really like the pattern and colors chosen in the composition.', '2006-10-25 11:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961074, 414490, 65779, '<td valign="top">I think the background could have been blurred a bit more for better bokeh.</td>', 'I think the background could have been blurred a bit more for better bokeh.', '2006-10-25 11:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961081, 414348, 65779, '<td valign="top">Simple but good. 6.</td>', 'Simple but good. 6.', '2006-10-25 11:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961094, 416599, 15711, '<td valign="top">There''s really nothing artful about this image.  I "get it," but the composition, light, subject matter - none of it has any appeal, particularly in a competition.  Hope this is helpful. People complain that the lower scoring images don''t get remarks, so......</td>', 'There''s really nothing artful about this image.  I "get it," but the composition, light, subject matter - none of it has any appeal, particularly in a competition.  Hope this is helpful. People complain that the lower scoring images don''t get remarks, so......', '2006-10-25 11:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961096, 416960, 64175, '<td valign="top">The crayons are a bit washed out in the image due to the flash/lighting.</td>', 'The crayons are a bit washed out in the image due to the flash/lighting.', '2006-10-25 11:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961097, 415076, 35804, '<td valign="top">VERY pretty...the color and light are just lovely and the bokeh truly enhances the subject...nicely done.</td>', 'VERY pretty...the color and light are just lovely and the bokeh truly enhances the subject...nicely done.', '2006-10-25 11:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961101, 415736, 64175, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and the bokeh enhances it perfectly. 10.</td>', 'Great portrait and the bokeh enhances it perfectly. 10.', '2006-10-25 11:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961102, 414866, 35804, '<td valign="top">Beautifully muted...this is just very pleasing to look at...well done.</td>', 'Beautifully muted...this is just very pleasing to look at...well done.', '2006-10-25 11:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961106, 414682, 64175, '<td valign="top">At first the cat looked like a white iron sitting on the floor. The title was necessary to decifer what was in the background.</td>', 'At first the cat looked like a white iron sitting on the floor. The title was necessary to decifer what was in the background.', '2006-10-25 11:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961108, 415698, 3102, '<td valign="top">A very unique and interesting shot, no question!  I''m afraid it''s not a good representation of the challenge, though... there''s no bokeh to speak of.</td>', 'A very unique and interesting shot, no question!  I''m afraid it''s not a good representation of the challenge, though... there''s no bokeh to speak of.', '2006-10-25 11:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961112, 414089, 64175, '<td valign="top">Now there''s one for the family scrapbook.  Nice job.</td>', 'Now there''s one for the family scrapbook.  Nice job.', '2006-10-25 11:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961115, 414648, 3102, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot, but bokeh and double exposure are not one in the same.</td>', 'An interesting shot, but bokeh and double exposure are not one in the same.', '2006-10-25 11:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961120, 414042, 15711, '<td valign="top">The idea of this is a crowd pleaser, but I feel that the butterfly isn''t tack sharp as it needs to be to really have the impact this image deserves. The colors are lovely, the diagonal line of the twig is good, but the subject is blurred.</td>', 'The idea of this is a crowd pleaser, but I feel that the butterfly isn''t tack sharp as it needs to be to really have the impact this image deserves. The colors are lovely, the diagonal line of the twig is good, but the subject is blurred.', '2006-10-25 11:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961123, 414628, 35804, '<td valign="top">Ah! Great catch...just wish I could see it without the "border", it just doesn''t enhance the image in any sort of way...but I just adore the chickdee.</td>', 'Ah! Great catch...just wish I could see it without the "border", it just doesn''t enhance the image in any sort of way...but I just adore the chickdee.', '2006-10-25 11:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961125, 416771, 64175, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time finding what is in focus in the photo. I think its the branch in the upper right corner.  Overall, I as a viewer, just don''t really think that the bokeh here really enhances the photo.</td>', 'I have a hard time finding what is in focus in the photo. I think its the branch in the upper right corner.  Overall, I as a viewer, just don''t really think that the bokeh here really enhances the photo.', '2006-10-25 11:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961129, 416446, 15711, '<td valign="top">I fail to see bokeh. I guess the subject is the water drips, but it just doesn''t have much oomph to my eye.  Maybe if there were more of a close up sense of the water, and the shadow behind the door were pushed back more, it might have more impact. Hope this is helpful. ;~D</td>', 'I fail to see bokeh. I guess the subject is the water drips, but it just doesn''t have much oomph to my eye.  Maybe if there were more of a close up sense of the water, and the shadow behind the door were pushed back more, it might have more impact. Hope this is helpful. ;~D', '2006-10-25 11:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961130, 414202, 64175, '<td valign="top">There is so much light coming from behind the glass that it makes me think a the wine glass is being poured on the road and there is an oncoming car that is going to hit it.  The bokeh circles too are very harsh with their hard 7 edge circles.  The wine and wine glass were shot very well.</td>', 'There is so much light coming from behind the glass that it makes me think a the wine glass is being poured on the road and there is an oncoming car that is going to hit it.  The bokeh circles too are very harsh with their hard 7 edge circles.  The wine and wine glass were shot very well.', '2006-10-25 11:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961133, 415816, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love zinnias. Rather expected, but very well done. I like the cool tones of the background with the warm tones of the flower. Nicely lit as well. 7</td>', 'I love zinnias. Rather expected, but very well done. I like the cool tones of the background with the warm tones of the flower. Nicely lit as well. 7', '2006-10-25 11:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961135, 415714, 64175, '<td valign="top">The lighting has really blown out the body of the cat so rather than have the bokeh enhance the image, it appears to have taken away from the image in this case.  Sorry.</td>', 'The lighting has really blown out the body of the cat so rather than have the bokeh enhance the image, it appears to have taken away from the image in this case.  Sorry.', '2006-10-25 11:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961140, 413585, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has no bokeh.  If you had the single leaf in front up close, with the grapes and other leaves quite far away, it would create the DOF needed to really make this image work. I hope you find this helpful. ;~D</td>', 'This has no bokeh.  If you had the single leaf in front up close, with the grapes and other leaves quite far away, it would create the DOF needed to really make this image work. I hope you find this helpful. ;~D', '2006-10-25 11:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961155, 416939, 35804, '<td valign="top">I just love cosmos....so pretty.</td>', 'I just love cosmos....so pretty.', '2006-10-25 11:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961184, 415234, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. One of the few that is artfully done with light and composition. Nice color and DOF.</td>', 'Very pretty. One of the few that is artfully done with light and composition. Nice color and DOF.', '2006-10-25 11:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961190, 416113, 15711, '<td valign="top">A touch tight with the crop, but GREAT DOF and bokeh. The tack sharp focus on the little guy''s face and hands is superb. One of the few that actually suits the challenge.</td>', 'A touch tight with the crop, but GREAT DOF and bokeh. The tack sharp focus on the little guy''s face and hands is superb. One of the few that actually suits the challenge.', '2006-10-25 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961191, 416267, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Love the bokeh being in front and behind the subject of the eye.  Artfully done. 7</td>', 'Nicely done.  Love the bokeh being in front and behind the subject of the eye.  Artfully done. 7', '2006-10-25 11:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961196, 416257, 15711, '<td valign="top">As boring as a stump is, this is one of the better bokeh shots in my opnion. It has a tack sharp focuson the subject and the blurred splotches of color in the background, are appealing and help aid in the appeal of the shot. 7</td>', 'As boring as a stump is, this is one of the better bokeh shots in my opnion. It has a tack sharp focuson the subject and the blurred splotches of color in the background, are appealing and help aid in the appeal of the shot. 7', '2006-10-25 11:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961197, 414814, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF. I like the black/purple of the background. One of the better shots, technically, of the challenge. 8</td>', 'Excellent DOF. I like the black/purple of the background. One of the better shots, technically, of the challenge. 8', '2006-10-25 11:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961202, 416149, 15711, '<td valign="top">She''s lovely. The overall image has a blue tinge to it.  Not sure if I care for that, but the movement of her hair is a nice touch and the bokeh definitely suits the challenge.  I think this might really be effective in a duotone or black and white as well.</td>', 'She''s lovely. The overall image has a blue tinge to it.  Not sure if I care for that, but the movement of her hair is a nice touch and the bokeh definitely suits the challenge.  I think this might really be effective in a duotone or black and white as well.', '2006-10-25 11:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961204, 416793, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the vivid red and detail of the leaf''s veins but I feel that it is "chopped" by the way you did the crop. The bokeh is great but the overall sense of it makes me think "gee, I wish they''d backed up a bit."</td>', 'I love the vivid red and detail of the leaf''s veins but I feel that it is "chopped" by the way you did the crop. The bokeh is great but the overall sense of it makes me think "gee, I wish they''d backed up a bit."', '2006-10-25 11:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961210, 416956, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice set up. I like the guy on the left, with the cell phone. I wonder how this will be received, despite the fact that it suits the challenge more than about 70% of the rest of them. LOL  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice set up. I like the guy on the left, with the cell phone. I wonder how this will be received, despite the fact that it suits the challenge more than about 70% of the rest of them. LOL  Good luck.', '2006-10-25 11:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961213, 416306, 15711, '<td valign="top">A touch tight on the crop, but this has the typical circles in the background and it works quite well.  I wish that the bird could have a touch more highlight on him, but the focus is good and the background is what DPCers love in a bokeh image. 7</td>', 'A touch tight on the crop, but this has the typical circles in the background and it works quite well.  I wish that the bird could have a touch more highlight on him, but the focus is good and the background is what DPCers love in a bokeh image. 7', '2006-10-25 11:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961215, 416817, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the background but the subject seems a tad oversharpened.</td>', 'Love the background but the subject seems a tad oversharpened.', '2006-10-25 11:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961220, 415067, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really lovely. Boy - those circles!!  Quite artfully composed. One of the better images of the challenge. Congratulations. I think it will do well for you. If I were to change anything, I might have the leaf so that the dark shadows of the grass weren''t so obvious, but otherwise, nice. 8</td>', 'Really lovely. Boy - those circles!!  Quite artfully composed. One of the better images of the challenge. Congratulations. I think it will do well for you. If I were to change anything, I might have the leaf so that the dark shadows of the grass weren''t so obvious, but otherwise, nice. 8', '2006-10-25 11:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961226, 416823, 15711, '<td valign="top">CUTE! Different take on the challenge. Very artfully done. I like the subject matter, the composition and it meets the challenge.  I''m afraid the colorful sparkly circles might come back to haunt you, but I hope I''m wrong.  8</td>', 'CUTE! Different take on the challenge. Very artfully done. I like the subject matter, the composition and it meets the challenge.  I''m afraid the colorful sparkly circles might come back to haunt you, but I hope I''m wrong.  8', '2006-10-25 11:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961228, 416961, 52854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!</td>', 'Beautiful photo!', '2006-10-25 11:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961231, 416736, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. This reminds me of one of boomtaps that I added to favs. I like the minimalism. It almost makes me think it''s cold.  The vertical lines of the stems make a nice repeated pattern. Great DOF. Pretty.</td>', 'Beautiful. This reminds me of one of boomtaps that I added to favs. I like the minimalism. It almost makes me think it''s cold.  The vertical lines of the stems make a nice repeated pattern. Great DOF. Pretty.', '2006-10-25 11:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961236, 414578, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh. I like the color of the left leaf.  I''d like it if it were a singleton on the line, with the second one and that yellow blob in the lower right, completely gone. Beautiful blue/yellow theme in the background.</td>', 'Nice bokeh. I like the color of the left leaf.  I''d like it if it were a singleton on the line, with the second one and that yellow blob in the lower right, completely gone. Beautiful blue/yellow theme in the background.', '2006-10-25 12:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
