(2961531, 414042, 64175, '<td valign="top">The colors in your bokeh are very nice, but I don''t find the right half to be soft enough. The left side defintitely, but the right side comes off as very streaky rather than a nice blend.  Nice capture of the butterfly and overall composition is good.</td>', 'The colors in your bokeh are very nice, but I don''t find the right half to be soft enough. The left side defintitely, but the right side comes off as very streaky rather than a nice blend.  Nice capture of the butterfly and overall composition is good.', '2006-10-25 13:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961533, 416971, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro.  I guess focus on the "face" would have been better, but with a razor-thin depth of field like this, that might not have looked best.  Bokeh is very nice and soft.</td>', 'Very nice macro.  I guess focus on the "face" would have been better, but with a razor-thin depth of field like this, that might not have looked best.  Bokeh is very nice and soft.', '2006-10-25 13:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961537, 416020, 52336, '<td valign="top">The bokeh looks kind of "wirey", but that''s not generally the photographer''s fault.  I like the pastel feel of it however.</td>', 'The bokeh looks kind of "wirey", but that''s not generally the photographer''s fault.  I like the pastel feel of it however.', '2006-10-25 13:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961539, 416306, 64175, '<td valign="top">The light circles right around the head (just above and on neck) almost take away from the image by making the subject appear blurred. The subject is in focus if I stare straight on at it, but the belly and head don''t really do well with the circles so close to them.</td>', 'The light circles right around the head (just above and on neck) almost take away from the image by making the subject appear blurred. The subject is in focus if I stare straight on at it, but the belly and head don''t really do well with the circles so close to them.', '2006-10-25 13:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961540, 416856, 2490, '<td valign="top">She needs to lean forward just a teeeeeeny bit :)</td>', 'She needs to lean forward just a teeeeeeny bit :)', '2006-10-25 13:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961542, 416953, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely!  Beautifully done!   I hope its doing well.</td>', 'This is just lovely!  Beautifully done!   I hope its doing well.', '2006-10-25 13:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961545, 414877, 64175, '<td valign="top">The bokeh here IMO actually comes off as a bit of lens flare (distraction) instead of enhancing the image.  I love the sunlight through the petals and the vivid yellow.</td>', 'The bokeh here IMO actually comes off as a bit of lens flare (distraction) instead of enhancing the image.  I love the sunlight through the petals and the vivid yellow.', '2006-10-25 13:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961548, 415438, 2490, '<td valign="top">Love the theme, but a little fill flash to put some light on her face would have really helped, I think.</td>', 'Love the theme, but a little fill flash to put some light on her face would have really helped, I think.', '2006-10-25 13:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961550, 416186, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely!  Clean, sharp, and beautiful lighting and bokeh!  Onen of my few favorites in this challenge!</td>', 'This is really lovely!  Clean, sharp, and beautiful lighting and bokeh!  Onen of my few favorites in this challenge!', '2006-10-25 13:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961552, 416852, 62723, '<td valign="top">great title!</td>', 'great title!', '2006-10-25 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961553, 416981, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice classic bokeh circles, very pretty indeed, not showing the "rim" that usually suggests a poor quality lens.  The light is very soft and lovely as well.  I have to mention the not altogether thrilling subject of the soap bottle though. :)  I would have also preferred it in frame at right, and more vertically positioned - that is, the bottle''s edge lined up perfectly with the image border.  Would have been more visually effective for me.  Bokeh is great though.</td>', 'Nice classic bokeh circles, very pretty indeed, not showing the "rim" that usually suggests a poor quality lens.  The light is very soft and lovely as well.  I have to mention the not altogether thrilling subject of the soap bottle though. :)  I would have also preferred it in frame at right, and more vertically positioned - that is, the bottle''s edge lined up perfectly with the image border.  Would have been more visually effective for me.  Bokeh is great though.', '2006-10-25 13:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961554, 415781, 62723, '<td valign="top">clever. Nice lighting. An 8</td>', 'clever. Nice lighting. An 8', '2006-10-25 13:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961555, 416149, 2490, '<td valign="top">She looks more cold than wet.   White balance feels wrong.</td>', 'She looks more cold than wet.   White balance feels wrong.', '2006-10-25 13:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961560, 416913, 64175, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is pretty deep in this one so I don''t really perceive it as bokeh.  It comes off as just a hazy background around the mountain.  It is a nice landscape photo.</td>', 'The depth of field is pretty deep in this one so I don''t really perceive it as bokeh.  It comes off as just a hazy background around the mountain.  It is a nice landscape photo.', '2006-10-25 13:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961561, 416820, 2490, '<td valign="top">Out of focus feet bother me here.</td>', 'Out of focus feet bother me here.', '2006-10-25 13:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961562, 414477, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture.  The bokeh is obvious, but in my view not particularly an important part of this image.  The surfer dude is way more important.</td>', 'Very cool capture.  The bokeh is obvious, but in my view not particularly an important part of this image.  The surfer dude is way more important.', '2006-10-25 13:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961564, 416476, 49652, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  Truly enhanced by the background bokeh.</td>', 'Beautifully done.  Truly enhanced by the background bokeh.', '2006-10-25 13:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961565, 416920, 49652, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and dreamy.  Love the colors.</td>', 'Beautiful and dreamy.  Love the colors.', '2006-10-25 13:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
