(2961709, 413585, 16488, '<td valign="top">The textures must have been appealing in reality...but there''s little else  here to hold my interest. (Don''t see anything I''d call bokeh in the broadest sense of the term, either.)</td>', 'The textures must have been appealing in reality...but there''s little else  here to hold my interest. (Don''t see anything I''d call bokeh in the broadest sense of the term, either.)', '2006-10-25 14:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
