(2961724, 416834, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus on the beetle. I really like the placement in the shot and how he''s slightly off kilter on the blossom. I think this suits the challenge very well. Nice lighting and the busy bokeh in the background does add to the shot, to my way of thinking.  Good luck. This is sooo superior to most!! 8</td>', 'Excellent focus on the beetle. I really like the placement in the shot and how he''s slightly off kilter on the blossom. I think this suits the challenge very well. Nice lighting and the busy bokeh in the background does add to the shot, to my way of thinking.  Good luck. This is sooo superior to most!! 8', '2006-10-25 14:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961728, 415173, 15711, '<td valign="top">Just not excited by a photo of a statue. It is bokeh, but the lack of color hurts it a bit more for me.  Technically, it''s good, but the subject matter is just lackluster to my way of thinking.</td>', 'Just not excited by a photo of a statue. It is bokeh, but the lack of color hurts it a bit more for me.  Technically, it''s good, but the subject matter is just lackluster to my way of thinking.', '2006-10-25 14:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
