(2961743, 417015, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is definitely bokeh, but I think it lacks the PUNCH I was looking for.  I think all of the gray tones just dull the pretty peachy color in the sky. There is that hint of a tree, or another cloud at the bottom, which I find a tad distracting. I''m trying to comment on some of my lower scoring images, as people complain that nobody says anything. The idea is fine, but it just leaves me a bit flat. 5</td>', 'This is definitely bokeh, but I think it lacks the PUNCH I was looking for.  I think all of the gray tones just dull the pretty peachy color in the sky. There is that hint of a tree, or another cloud at the bottom, which I find a tad distracting. I''m trying to comment on some of my lower scoring images, as people complain that nobody says anything. The idea is fine, but it just leaves me a bit flat. 5', '2006-10-25 14:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2961744, 415270, 67257, '<td valign="top">The model is beautiful. I could look at her all day.  The only issue is that she takes up a majority of the picture.  For Bokeh you want to have an equal mix between focus and out of focus if not more out of focus.  It is still a great shot.  Congratulations!!!</td>', 'The model is beautiful. I could look at her all day.  The only issue is that she takes up a majority of the picture.  For Bokeh you want to have an equal mix between focus and out of focus if not more out of focus.  It is still a great shot.  Congratulations!!!', '2006-10-25 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
