(2961798, 413929, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty, but with the black background, I am not having quite as much sense of bokeh, but that might be thinking too narrowly, so I won''t deduct for it.  The vivid fuschia and wonderful light really adds to the shot. Great focus on the petals in the foreground, with the one oof, which I like.  Good luck. It''s good.</td>', 'This is very pretty, but with the black background, I am not having quite as much sense of bokeh, but that might be thinking too narrowly, so I won''t deduct for it.  The vivid fuschia and wonderful light really adds to the shot. Great focus on the petals in the foreground, with the one oof, which I like.  Good luck. It''s good.', '2006-10-25 14:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
