(2962163, 414884, 16488, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what you''re going for here. Is it the smiling soldier or the wall that is the subject? Something odd going on with the color in the sky...yellow clouds?</td>', 'Not really sure what you''re going for here. Is it the smiling soldier or the wall that is the subject? Something odd going on with the color in the sky...yellow clouds?', '2006-10-25 16:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
