(2962170, 416217, 16488, '<td valign="top">I can see you were going for a romantic portrait. Her pose and expression are nice. The light is a bit harsh throughout the image...it casts heavy shadows on your model''s face and creates a difficult exposure with the background. I''d like to see more blur in the background to help set the model off. Compositionally, I think she''s too near the left of the frame almost creating a merger. It''s the details that make or break an image.</td>', 'I can see you were going for a romantic portrait. Her pose and expression are nice. The light is a bit harsh throughout the image...it casts heavy shadows on your model''s face and creates a difficult exposure with the background. I''d like to see more blur in the background to help set the model off. Compositionally, I think she''s too near the left of the frame almost creating a merger. It''s the details that make or break an image.', '2006-10-25 16:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962174, 416852, 52549, '<td valign="top">Love it. The only tiny nit-pick I have is that the main subject is slap in the middle. Good luck though.</td>', 'Love it. The only tiny nit-pick I have is that the main subject is slap in the middle. Good luck though.', '2006-10-25 16:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
