(2962995, 415900, 67335, '<td valign="top">Great picture, but IMO DNMC.</td>', 'Great picture, but IMO DNMC.', '2006-10-25 20:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2962999, 416889, 43774, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I can''t tell if the background is natural or staged. I like how it complements the spikes of the cactus and the bright orange colour says "stay away, danger!" which is what the spikes represent as well. Well done!</td>', 'I really like this. I can''t tell if the background is natural or staged. I like how it complements the spikes of the cactus and the bright orange colour says "stay away, danger!" which is what the spikes represent as well. Well done!', '2006-10-25 20:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963000, 414780, 42179, '<td valign="top">Bokeh ?</td>', 'Bokeh ?', '2006-10-25 20:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963014, 416993, 42179, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2006-10-25 20:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963024, 416979, 67335, '<td valign="top">DNMC</td>', 'DNMC', '2006-10-25 20:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963028, 415067, 42179, '<td valign="top">Very nice - 7</td>', 'Very nice - 7', '2006-10-25 20:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963036, 417014, 45475, '<td valign="top">:) Very very funny. I think it suffers a bit from over-sharpening, but it still gets the giggle vote from me!</td>', ':) Very very funny. I think it suffers a bit from over-sharpening, but it still gets the giggle vote from me!', '2006-10-25 20:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963043, 414864, 67335, '<td valign="top">I love this image - the leaf crossing over the berries is distracting, though.</td>', 'I love this image - the leaf crossing over the berries is distracting, though.', '2006-10-25 20:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963051, 416686, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice work. Love the purity of the light here, perfect for the subject matter. Well done!</td>', 'Wow, nice work. Love the purity of the light here, perfect for the subject matter. Well done!', '2006-10-25 20:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963060, 416823, 110909, '<td valign="top">my first 10.  well done!</td>', 'my first 10.  well done!', '2006-10-25 20:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963070, 415541, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the focus on the main zinnia, but I think what hurts it, is what hurts shots in nature: clutter.  I might''ve moved the one to the right, out of the way, so that the main one and even the bud in front of it have more emphasis.</td>', 'I love the colors and the focus on the main zinnia, but I think what hurts it, is what hurts shots in nature: clutter.  I might''ve moved the one to the right, out of the way, so that the main one and even the bud in front of it have more emphasis.', '2006-10-25 20:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963083, 415510, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the rich contrast of the butterfly. The bokeh is great.  What hurts it to my eye is the flower in the foreground.  It''s hard not to be able to rearrange a natural setting particularly with a living creature that can fly off, at any second. If you could''ve done it perfectly, you could have asked Mr. Butterfly, "pardon me, while I remove this bloom in the way." LOL</td>', 'I love the rich contrast of the butterfly. The bokeh is great.  What hurts it to my eye is the flower in the foreground.  It''s hard not to be able to rearrange a natural setting particularly with a living creature that can fly off, at any second. If you could''ve done it perfectly, you could have asked Mr. Butterfly, "pardon me, while I remove this bloom in the way." LOL', '2006-10-25 20:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963094, 416247, 66384, '<td valign="top">I can smell it!</td>', 'I can smell it!', '2006-10-25 20:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963095, 416416, 54540, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  Took me a moment to see the 2nd impala in the bokeh!  Well done!</td>', 'Whoa!  Took me a moment to see the 2nd impala in the bokeh!  Well done!', '2006-10-25 20:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963111, 415221, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very funny and nicely done.</td>', 'Very funny and nicely done.', '2006-10-25 20:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963120, 416771, 66384, '<td valign="top">It works for me!</td>', 'It works for me!', '2006-10-25 20:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963121, 416201, 49652, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous!</td>', 'This is gorgeous!', '2006-10-25 20:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963124, 416980, 54540, '<td valign="top">Excellent water color effect in your bokeh!  Very pleasing.<br/>I would like to see the background repositioned somewhat behind the subject though - meaning during the initial camera placement.  I think it could add to a stronger compositon.  (just my preference)</td>', 'Excellent water color effect in your bokeh!  Very pleasing.I would like to see the background repositioned somewhat behind the subject though - meaning during the initial camera placement.  I think it could add to a stronger compositon.  (just my preference)', '2006-10-25 20:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963125, 416119, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like it!</td>', 'I like it!', '2006-10-25 20:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963132, 416942, 54540, '<td valign="top">Cool end result and I like this composition.  Well done.<br/>A bit less on the grains in the bokeh would be my preference, however.</td>', 'Cool end result and I like this composition.  Well done.A bit less on the grains in the bokeh would be my preference, however.', '2006-10-25 20:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963137, 414739, 63218, '<td valign="top">I like how plain &amp; simple this is</td>', 'I like how plain & simple this is', '2006-10-25 20:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963148, 416968, 45475, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! :D</td>', 'Brilliant! :D', '2006-10-25 20:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963157, 414812, 65603, '<td valign="top">I like this pic.... but it unfortunately loses the "boken" to it in the white.</td>', 'I like this pic.... but it unfortunately loses the "boken" to it in the white.', '2006-10-25 20:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963162, 413585, 65603, '<td valign="top">Not seeing the boken....</td>', 'Not seeing the boken....', '2006-10-25 20:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963206, 414628, 63218, '<td valign="top">OMG! this is so cute!</td>', 'OMG! this is so cute!', '2006-10-25 20:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963213, 415319, 32345, '<td valign="top">You did get the Bokeh concept pretty good, the problem with your pic is the noise and it needs more sharpness</td>', 'You did get the Bokeh concept pretty good, the problem with your pic is the noise and it needs more sharpness', '2006-10-25 20:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963229, 415234, 32754, '<td valign="top">this is lovely; I like the fern shapes and soft sense of movement...also, the tones are beautiful..well done.</td>', 'this is lovely; I like the fern shapes and soft sense of movement...also, the tones are beautiful..well done.', '2006-10-25 20:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963236, 414780, 31307, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought this was an image of a duck hunt lol.  Whoops!</td>', 'At first glance I thought this was an image of a duck hunt lol.  Whoops!', '2006-10-25 20:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963258, 415900, 60698, '<td valign="top">THis is a fabulous shot. It might be a bit of a stretch to call it bokeh, but nice work just the same.</td>', 'THis is a fabulous shot. It might be a bit of a stretch to call it bokeh, but nice work just the same.', '2006-10-25 21:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963261, 416979, 31307, '<td valign="top">What is the message of this image?  What are you trying to convey to the viewer?</td>', 'What is the message of this image?  What are you trying to convey to the viewer?', '2006-10-25 21:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963274, 415698, 31307, '<td valign="top">I think this image would really have benefited from a stronger use of the rule of thirds.  Placing the focal point smack in the center like that is practically never a good idea.  Other than that, I think that this image is very very cool.  Nice use of contrast and pattern to creat a dynamic shot.</td>', 'I think this image would really have benefited from a stronger use of the rule of thirds.  Placing the focal point smack in the center like that is practically never a good idea.  Other than that, I think that this image is very very cool.  Nice use of contrast and pattern to creat a dynamic shot.', '2006-10-25 21:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963285, 416261, 60698, '<td valign="top">Can''t figure out what this is. Uh.... hash pipe? :) The composition is pleasing, but I don''t get it.</td>', 'Can''t figure out what this is. Uh.... hash pipe? :) The composition is pleasing, but I don''t get it.', '2006-10-25 21:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963303, 416510, 54540, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of using the full rose in the bokeh - poetic!  Good choice for the title too.<br/>My prefernce would be to tone down the brightness of the full bloom in the bokeh, to allow the subject to be more visible - but that gets tough in basic editing.  Good entry!</td>', 'I like the idea of using the full rose in the bokeh - poetic!  Good choice for the title too.My prefernce would be to tone down the brightness of the full bloom in the bokeh, to allow the subject to be more visible - but that gets tough in basic editing.  Good entry!', '2006-10-25 21:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963308, 414477, 35602, '<td valign="top">nice background.  found tne foreground distracted rather than enhanced</td>', 'nice background.  found tne foreground distracted rather than enhanced', '2006-10-25 21:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963315, 416771, 35602, '<td valign="top">very soothing composition.</td>', 'very soothing composition.', '2006-10-25 21:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963323, 414679, 35602, '<td valign="top">Definitely used bokeh, but it overpowers the subject.  Need maybe lower iso, and perhaps an exposure compensation would have calmed down the bokeh.</td>', 'Definitely used bokeh, but it overpowers the subject.  Need maybe lower iso, and perhaps an exposure compensation would have calmed down the bokeh.', '2006-10-25 21:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963334, 416979, 54540, '<td valign="top">To get the bokeh effect in this image, it''s important to focus on only one area - here the background really should be blurred to the extreme, or even the sign in the foreground.  (Use manual focus and a wide open f-stop if possible)<br/>Hope that helps.</td>', 'To get the bokeh effect in this image, it''s important to focus on only one area - here the background really should be blurred to the extreme, or even the sign in the foreground.  (Use manual focus and a wide open f-stop if possible)Hope that helps.', '2006-10-25 21:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963355, 416025, 62024, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, i give you 7, a lot of that is based on your funny idea of subject and title</td>', 'Hehehe, i give you 7, a lot of that is based on your funny idea of subject and title', '2006-10-25 21:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963361, 416306, 60698, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Nice!', '2006-10-25 21:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963369, 415234, 60698, '<td valign="top">A real work of art. Wouldn''t change anything!</td>', 'A real work of art. Wouldn''t change anything!', '2006-10-25 21:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963374, 414663, 60698, '<td valign="top">Very striking! Beautiful bokeh.</td>', 'Very striking! Beautiful bokeh.', '2006-10-25 21:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963385, 416679, 60698, '<td valign="top">First time I''ve seen bokeh in the foreground. A fantastic capture!</td>', 'First time I''ve seen bokeh in the foreground. A fantastic capture!', '2006-10-25 21:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963393, 416968, 60698, '<td valign="top">Funny!! Nice use of bokeh here! Nice color and composition.</td>', 'Funny!! Nice use of bokeh here! Nice color and composition.', '2006-10-25 21:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963410, 416839, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice Bokeh with good color. Skin looks very soft and pretty. Perhaps her head could have been turned a tad more to the camera or her pretty blond hair hanging loose?</td>', 'Nice Bokeh with good color. Skin looks very soft and pretty. Perhaps her head could have been turned a tad more to the camera or her pretty blond hair hanging loose?', '2006-10-25 21:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963416, 415731, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of which subject to blur. I think most people would have preferred a sharp zebra, but this works well.</td>', 'Interesting choice of which subject to blur. I think most people would have preferred a sharp zebra, but this works well.', '2006-10-25 21:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963421, 414021, 12733, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, well done.</td>', 'Clever idea, well done.', '2006-10-25 21:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963423, 414859, 12733, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this meets the definition of bokeh, but it''s a beautiful capture!</td>', 'I''m not sure this meets the definition of bokeh, but it''s a beautiful capture!', '2006-10-25 21:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963424, 415948, 12733, '<td valign="top">great texture and shine on the metal.</td>', 'great texture and shine on the metal.', '2006-10-25 21:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963428, 416979, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the background is really to sharp for bokeh. It''s almost in focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the background is really to sharp for bokeh. It''s almost in focus.', '2006-10-25 21:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963431, 414696, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great expression on that bird''s face! The background is interesting and nicely blurred.</td>', 'Great expression on that bird''s face! The background is interesting and nicely blurred.', '2006-10-25 21:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963438, 416986, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great shine on the berries, and the background color complements it. Those white blobs of light take away some from the effect.</td>', 'Great shine on the berries, and the background color complements it. Those white blobs of light take away some from the effect.', '2006-10-25 21:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963443, 416534, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but too contrasty for my taste. I think the flower should take up more of the overall picture.</td>', 'Nice composition, but too contrasty for my taste. I think the flower should take up more of the overall picture.', '2006-10-25 21:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963488, 415264, 65858, '<td valign="top">Original shot - the thick top/bottom border is very attractive on this on.  Good work!</td>', 'Original shot - the thick top/bottom border is very attractive on this on.  Good work!', '2006-10-25 22:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963496, 417026, 65858, '<td valign="top">Wow - great use of Bokeh to enhance this image.  It would have been dull otherwise.  But as is, the subject is the barbs, while the hint of a prison tower provides the perfect context.  Excellent!</td>', 'Wow - great use of Bokeh to enhance this image.  It would have been dull otherwise.  But as is, the subject is the barbs, while the hint of a prison tower provides the perfect context.  Excellent!', '2006-10-25 22:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963505, 413944, 65858, '<td valign="top">Good shot - it looks a little oversharpened, which is sometimes hard to see on LCD screens or others with low ocntrast.</td>', 'Good shot - it looks a little oversharpened, which is sometimes hard to see on LCD screens or others with low ocntrast.', '2006-10-25 22:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963506, 415840, 63218, '<td valign="top">remarkable shot!</td>', 'remarkable shot!', '2006-10-25 22:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963508, 415080, 65858, '<td valign="top">With a bun in the over myself, you got me on this one!  =)  Gotta play to the judges!</td>', 'With a bun in the over myself, you got me on this one!  =)  Gotta play to the judges!', '2006-10-25 22:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963511, 416141, 65858, '<td valign="top">whom.</td>', 'whom.', '2006-10-25 22:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963519, 415105, 65858, '<td valign="top">Technicall very good - crisp focus, the near monotone green is very nice.  Great work!</td>', 'Technicall very good - crisp focus, the near monotone green is very nice.  Great work!', '2006-10-25 22:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963522, 417012, 67257, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this shot.</td>', 'I love the colors in this shot.', '2006-10-25 22:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963526, 416457, 65858, '<td valign="top">Wow - nice portraiture!  (If that''s a word!)  I love that the face is crisp and sharp from the tip of her nose back to her eyes (many get one and not the other), and then the focus fades away.  Very pleasing backlighting.<br/> <br/>The only thing that''s a bit off is that her left eye is shadowed more than her right, which unbalances her eyes, just a bit.<br/> <br/>Still, I like it!  8!<br/> <br/>Revised after more voting -&gt; I like it a lot! 9</td>', 'Wow - nice portraiture!  (If that''s a word!)  I love that the face is crisp and sharp from the tip of her nose back to her eyes (many get one and not the other), and then the focus fades away.  Very pleasing backlighting. The only thing that''s a bit off is that her left eye is shadowed more than her right, which unbalances her eyes, just a bit. Still, I like it!  8! Revised after more voting -> I like it a lot! 9', '2006-10-25 22:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963536, 414946, 67257, '<td valign="top">I never want to be on this end of a gun.  Great bokeh in the background.</td>', 'I never want to be on this end of a gun.  Great bokeh in the background.', '2006-10-25 22:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963538, 416530, 67257, '<td valign="top">Wow that is a great picture.</td>', 'Wow that is a great picture.', '2006-10-25 22:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963542, 415781, 67257, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.</td>', 'I like the idea.', '2006-10-25 22:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963545, 413911, 67257, '<td valign="top">Ha I like the idea.</td>', 'Ha I like the idea.', '2006-10-25 22:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963547, 413515, 44453, '<td valign="top">Wow - thats really bad - lots and lots of camera shake.</td>', 'Wow - thats really bad - lots and lots of camera shake.', '2006-10-25 22:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963549, 415698, 67257, '<td valign="top">That is a great visual effect</td>', 'That is a great visual effect', '2006-10-25 22:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963550, 414931, 44453, '<td valign="top">I like the bokeh but not the colour cast, slightly less orange would be an improvement</td>', 'I like the bokeh but not the colour cast, slightly less orange would be an improvement', '2006-10-25 22:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963552, 416682, 63206, '<td valign="top">Good, but it would have had a little more impact if there was a a tiny bit  more detail in the "abyss".</td>', 'Good, but it would have had a little more impact if there was a a tiny bit  more detail in the "abyss".', '2006-10-25 22:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963570, 416951, 44453, '<td valign="top">I can see plenty of things out of focus but I can''t see how it makes it a better photo - you still need to have a strong subject and observe basic rules about what makes a good photo.  The bagpiper would be a much better photo if he was facing you - (or alternatively if you moved a bit to the left) - and found a much less distracting background.</td>', 'I can see plenty of things out of focus but I can''t see how it makes it a better photo - you still need to have a strong subject and observe basic rules about what makes a good photo.  The bagpiper would be a much better photo if he was facing you - (or alternatively if you moved a bit to the left) - and found a much less distracting background.', '2006-10-25 22:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963571, 415323, 31829, '<td valign="top">Looks too PS''d to me.  I''m not saying that''s the method you used, but it just doesn''t seem natural to me.</td>', 'Looks too PS''d to me.  I''m not saying that''s the method you used, but it just doesn''t seem natural to me.', '2006-10-25 22:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963576, 416686, 44453, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but I think it might be slightly overexposed - it hurts my eyes</td>', 'I like the idea but I think it might be slightly overexposed - it hurts my eyes', '2006-10-25 22:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963579, 414282, 44453, '<td valign="top">wow - foreground and background bokeh - someone has been paying attention!!  I like it.  A very inquisitive looking creature.</td>', 'wow - foreground and background bokeh - someone has been paying attention!!  I like it.  A very inquisitive looking creature.', '2006-10-25 22:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963589, 416493, 44453, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait which is enhanced by good bokeh - there should be lots of this in a "bokeh challenge" but so far no luck.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait which is enhanced by good bokeh - there should be lots of this in a "bokeh challenge" but so far no luck.', '2006-10-25 22:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963598, 417024, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is sweet, simple and a classic. I even see a touch of bokeh in the stamens of the flowers. I like the sense of the blooms almost floating in a sea of green. 7</td>', 'This is sweet, simple and a classic. I even see a touch of bokeh in the stamens of the flowers. I like the sense of the blooms almost floating in a sea of green. 7', '2006-10-25 22:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963602, 414612, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this several times.  I adore the background. I think the one thing that is bothering me about the foreground is the part on the right where there is shadow/light/shadow/light.  I wonder what it would look like if you just cropped out the right third of the shot. I think it would clean it up and you''d still have that touch of shadow on the leaf on the left, under the stem. I''ve noticed this with several of the nature shots and it''s hard to compose what Mother Nature has put there. I still like it, but it''s a tad busy with all that''s going on, in the right third of the shot. I love the green leaves that are clear and not cluttered by other branches or overlapping ones.</td>', 'I''ve come back to this several times.  I adore the background. I think the one thing that is bothering me about the foreground is the part on the right where there is shadow/light/shadow/light.  I wonder what it would look like if you just cropped out the right third of the shot. I think it would clean it up and you''d still have that touch of shadow on the leaf on the left, under the stem. I''ve noticed this with several of the nature shots and it''s hard to compose what Mother Nature has put there. I still like it, but it''s a tad busy with all that''s going on, in the right third of the shot. I love the green leaves that are clear and not cluttered by other branches or overlapping ones.', '2006-10-25 22:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963603, 416416, 15711, '<td valign="top">The eyelashes! I love the detail of the entire face.  Wonderful rich browns with that hint of almost navy blue.  I like it. 7</td>', 'The eyelashes! I love the detail of the entire face.  Wonderful rich browns with that hint of almost navy blue.  I like it. 7', '2006-10-25 22:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
