(2963609, 413911, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is fun, a touch quirky and different. I like the duplicity of the "Eye" in the background and in the camera. I might work on the skin tones. They seem a tad orange.</td>', 'This is fun, a touch quirky and different. I like the duplicity of the "Eye" in the background and in the camera. I might work on the skin tones. They seem a tad orange.', '2006-10-25 22:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
