(2963618, 416662, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this several times. I gave it a 7 right off of the bat. I think it''s a bit different and you don''t expect to see the pastel sherbet colors when you see a spider. I like his placement in the shot. I might crop part off of the top, so it is a bit more proportionate, but that''s a nit pick.</td>', 'I''ve come back to this several times. I gave it a 7 right off of the bat. I think it''s a bit different and you don''t expect to see the pastel sherbet colors when you see a spider. I like his placement in the shot. I might crop part off of the top, so it is a bit more proportionate, but that''s a nit pick.', '2006-10-25 23:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
