(2963622, 415997, 15711, '<td valign="top">Anything with an icy theme appeals to me. I love that I can actually see the crystals on the edge of the leaf.  Beautiful smooth blues and greens in the background. 7</td>', 'Anything with an icy theme appeals to me. I love that I can actually see the crystals on the edge of the leaf.  Beautiful smooth blues and greens in the background. 7', '2006-10-25 23:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2963626, 414282, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has great DOF and the detail on his face is great. I know how hard it is to capture these guys cause I did it the other day and my shots were horrible.  The vivid green is really saturated, but just looks lush and delicious and not overdone. I sense a touch tight on the crop, as his leg is "cut off" just a smidge.</td>', 'This has great DOF and the detail on his face is great. I know how hard it is to capture these guys cause I did it the other day and my shots were horrible.  The vivid green is really saturated, but just looks lush and delicious and not overdone. I sense a touch tight on the crop, as his leg is "cut off" just a smidge.', '2006-10-25 23:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
