(2963650, 414604, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''ve gone back and forth on this one.  The bokeh is glorious, but the actual subject seems too intense if that makes sense. I''m the hugest fan of bright vivid colors, but somehow it seems off. I think my eye looks for colors that contrast, or go together, and I''m not sensing either. The stem seems oversharp to me. But still... I like it. LOL</td>', 'I''ve gone back and forth on this one.  The bokeh is glorious, but the actual subject seems too intense if that makes sense. I''m the hugest fan of bright vivid colors, but somehow it seems off. I think my eye looks for colors that contrast, or go together, and I''m not sensing either. The stem seems oversharp to me. But still... I like it. LOL', '2006-10-25 23:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
