(2963658, 413761, 15711, '<td valign="top">The is delicate, yet the rich dark tones of the butterflies POP off of the page because of the difference in their intensity and the light airy feeling of the background.  I love the diagonal line created by the branch. It''s quite lovely. I''m craving a border (but I''m the border queen - so ignore me). After looking at this about 5 times, and finally commenting, I''m bumping up. 9</td>', 'The is delicate, yet the rich dark tones of the butterflies POP off of the page because of the difference in their intensity and the light airy feeling of the background.  I love the diagonal line created by the branch. It''s quite lovely. I''m craving a border (but I''m the border queen - so ignore me). After looking at this about 5 times, and finally commenting, I''m bumping up. 9', '2006-10-25 23:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
