(2964118, 415714, 44453, '<td valign="top">the overexposure on the right hand leg really ruins an image with some potential.  I (unlike a lot of DPC voters) like cat photos and I think youve captured a great facial expression - and the bokeh of the nicely exposed leg has a nice feel to it, and I even like the severe crop of the head, but a good 50% of the photo is a blinding white, which is unattactive and makes the photo feel unbalanced.</td>', 'the overexposure on the right hand leg really ruins an image with some potential.  I (unlike a lot of DPC voters) like cat photos and I think youve captured a great facial expression - and the bokeh of the nicely exposed leg has a nice feel to it, and I even like the severe crop of the head, but a good 50% of the photo is a blinding white, which is unattactive and makes the photo feel unbalanced.', '2006-10-26 01:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964124, 416512, 44453, '<td valign="top">It''s good to see some foreground and background bokeh in the same photo - although here I think it overpowers the actual subject and its just a photo of bokeh, rather than a photo WITH bokeh</td>', 'It''s good to see some foreground and background bokeh in the same photo - although here I think it overpowers the actual subject and its just a photo of bokeh, rather than a photo WITH bokeh', '2006-10-26 01:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
