(2964261, 416437, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like it. Is that bokeh or distorted reflections? I don''t care really :) Its a beautiful image and a cool take on the challenge.</td>', 'I like it. Is that bokeh or distorted reflections? I don''t care really :) Its a beautiful image and a cool take on the challenge.', '2006-10-26 04:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964262, 415107, 65035, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty, soft and has a romantic feel, lovely.</td>', 'This is so pretty, soft and has a romantic feel, lovely.', '2006-10-26 04:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964263, 415518, 23300, '<td valign="top">Cool. This has a real "film noir" or gothic feel. It creates instant atmosphere and the bokeh plays an important part in creating the feeling.</td>', 'Cool. This has a real "film noir" or gothic feel. It creates instant atmosphere and the bokeh plays an important part in creating the feeling.', '2006-10-26 04:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964264, 414826, 23300, '<td valign="top">Really effective use of foreground bokeh. Jusy a great image.</td>', 'Really effective use of foreground bokeh. Jusy a great image.', '2006-10-26 04:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964268, 415888, 23300, '<td valign="top">Artfully done. Creates a powerful atmosphere.</td>', 'Artfully done. Creates a powerful atmosphere.', '2006-10-26 04:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964274, 416186, 23300, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous</td>', 'Gorgeous', '2006-10-26 04:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964277, 416885, 23300, '<td valign="top">The colours in the photo are beautiful and the bokeh supports the subject well. I don''t normally mind borders but I think this one robs the image of its impact.</td>', 'The colours in the photo are beautiful and the bokeh supports the subject well. I don''t normally mind borders but I think this one robs the image of its impact.', '2006-10-26 04:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964305, 416262, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this but I think it suffers from what many others do in that it''s cluttered. If there were just the single cotton stalk with the bird, it would have better composition, but in a natural setting, unless you go out there with a pair of scissors, cutting down things, then the bird wouldn''t be there. LOL. It has a blurred background, but not seeing it really adding to the shot. You could almost crop it so that the bird were much larger, and you''d lose all of the white fluff to the left, and I think it would be more cleaned up and have more eye appeal. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'I like this but I think it suffers from what many others do in that it''s cluttered. If there were just the single cotton stalk with the bird, it would have better composition, but in a natural setting, unless you go out there with a pair of scissors, cutting down things, then the bird wouldn''t be there. LOL. It has a blurred background, but not seeing it really adding to the shot. You could almost crop it so that the bird were much larger, and you''d lose all of the white fluff to the left, and I think it would be more cleaned up and have more eye appeal. Hope this is helpful.', '2006-10-26 05:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964308, 414864, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m a berry nut.  This is pretty but suffers from too much clutter. Hard to fix that in a natural setting. I might crop just above that diagaonal blade of grass in the foreground. That neatens it up a bit and you still get the wonderful background. Love the colors.</td>', 'I''m a berry nut.  This is pretty but suffers from too much clutter. Hard to fix that in a natural setting. I might crop just above that diagaonal blade of grass in the foreground. That neatens it up a bit and you still get the wonderful background. Love the colors.', '2006-10-26 05:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964310, 416671, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh but the subject seems a touch oversharp to my eye. I like that you incorporated blur in the foreground AND background. It seems a touch cluttered. I might crop a bit tighter to make the overall size of the butterfly larger. Love the title.</td>', 'Great bokeh but the subject seems a touch oversharp to my eye. I like that you incorporated blur in the foreground AND background. It seems a touch cluttered. I might crop a bit tighter to make the overall size of the butterfly larger. Love the title.', '2006-10-26 05:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964316, 415261, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bokeh but the subject (the plant) has a cluttered sense. What if you cropped it so that all you saw was the pink stem and single berry on the left and the one yellow leaf pointing up, and you''d just have the orientation different. It would hae tons of negative space and the plant would appear to be growing out of the corner. As it is, it just has a "every which a way" sense, but what can you do in nature, except pluck off a bunch of leaves? (I''ve done that. LOL)</td>', 'Beautiful bokeh but the subject (the plant) has a cluttered sense. What if you cropped it so that all you saw was the pink stem and single berry on the left and the one yellow leaf pointing up, and you''d just have the orientation different. It would hae tons of negative space and the plant would appear to be growing out of the corner. As it is, it just has a "every which a way" sense, but what can you do in nature, except pluck off a bunch of leaves? (I''ve done that. LOL)', '2006-10-26 05:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964319, 416367, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. The lighting is good. Maybe a touch hot on her left arm, but not so much that it is that distracting.  I''d probably crop out a considerable amount of the bottom just below her hand. I love an almost square crops anyway. Her eyes and the focus is great.  Maybe saturate the green a bit more. Still, a wonderful portrait.</td>', 'Very pretty. The lighting is good. Maybe a touch hot on her left arm, but not so much that it is that distracting.  I''d probably crop out a considerable amount of the bottom just below her hand. I love an almost square crops anyway. Her eyes and the focus is great.  Maybe saturate the green a bit more. Still, a wonderful portrait.', '2006-10-26 05:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964320, 414031, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely natural framing. I might play with levels a smidge to enrich the overall color tones.  The focus is spot on. 7</td>', 'Lovely natural framing. I might play with levels a smidge to enrich the overall color tones.  The focus is spot on. 7', '2006-10-26 05:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964323, 416186, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple and pretty. It seems a touch chopped off at the bottom. I love the glistening droplets.</td>', 'Simple and pretty. It seems a touch chopped off at the bottom. I love the glistening droplets.', '2006-10-26 05:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964326, 416862, 15711, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a touch harsh.  The crop has a "chopped off" sense to me. The bokeh is there - I''d like to see more of it with more negative space.</td>', 'The lighting seems a touch harsh.  The crop has a "chopped off" sense to me. The bokeh is there - I''d like to see more of it with more negative space.', '2006-10-26 05:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964328, 416992, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely bokeh. I''d like to have more detail on the bird''s feathers, and maybe include more of his body in the shot.</td>', 'Lovely bokeh. I''d like to have more detail on the bird''s feathers, and maybe include more of his body in the shot.', '2006-10-26 05:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964331, 416438, 15711, '<td valign="top">Makes me think I have had too many beers. LOL  Fun sense of movement. Since the whole image is blurred, I wonder if that truly meets the bokeh meaning, since there is not subject per se. Hmmmmm</td>', 'Makes me think I have had too many beers. LOL  Fun sense of movement. Since the whole image is blurred, I wonder if that truly meets the bokeh meaning, since there is not subject per se. Hmmmmm', '2006-10-26 05:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964333, 416048, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I might have plucked that bottom left flower - it seems a touch "cluttered" which is very common in a natural setting.</td>', 'Very pretty. I might have plucked that bottom left flower - it seems a touch "cluttered" which is very common in a natural setting.', '2006-10-26 05:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964335, 414490, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice setting. I would widen the crop on the right.  Also, straighten out the tilt of the horizon. Good focus on the sheep.</td>', 'Nice setting. I would widen the crop on the right.  Also, straighten out the tilt of the horizon. Good focus on the sheep.', '2006-10-26 05:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964337, 416972, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very fun and playful. Love the colors.</td>', 'Very fun and playful. Love the colors.', '2006-10-26 05:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964339, 415319, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple and neat. Not too cluttered like so many of the images. I might run it through neat image to get rid of the grain of the background. 7</td>', 'Simple and neat. Not too cluttered like so many of the images. I might run it through neat image to get rid of the grain of the background. 7', '2006-10-26 05:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964341, 416760, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific focus. Lovely background colors. I''d like to see more of his body.</td>', 'Terrific focus. Lovely background colors. I''d like to see more of his body.', '2006-10-26 05:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964346, 414739, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple. I like the lighting.  I might''ve removed the two stems poking at the bottom, to give it a more clean look. Hard to arrange Mother Nature for a shot without a pair of scissors. LOL Great bokeh.</td>', 'Simple. I like the lighting.  I might''ve removed the two stems poking at the bottom, to give it a more clean look. Hard to arrange Mother Nature for a shot without a pair of scissors. LOL Great bokeh.', '2006-10-26 05:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964347, 414877, 67324, '<td valign="top">I like it, i really like it. Only criticism: the web between flower petals and the sharp distraction on the left.<br/>7</td>', 'I like it, i really like it. Only criticism: the web between flower petals and the sharp distraction on the left.7', '2006-10-26 05:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964349, 416599, 54446, '<td valign="top">Superb representation of your personal motto.</td>', 'Superb representation of your personal motto.', '2006-10-26 05:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964350, 416725, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific focus on the eyes. Good detailing and DOF. Although the background blur is smooth and  even, the pattern is a touch distracting to my eye. 7</td>', 'Terrific focus on the eyes. Good detailing and DOF. Although the background blur is smooth and  even, the pattern is a touch distracting to my eye. 7', '2006-10-26 05:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964351, 416828, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good concept, color and leaf placement within the frame. Your image is very much like my own entry.</td>', 'Good concept, color and leaf placement within the frame. Your image is very much like my own entry.', '2006-10-26 05:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964352, 416939, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the DOF. I might''ve had it set up on a tripod, looked through the viewfinder, and then plucked, selectively, the blooms that make it a bit too cluttered. I''d remove the bottom left, and the taller one on the left, as well as the small one below the bloom on the right. Then, to my eye, compositionally, it would be more clean.</td>', 'I like the colors and the DOF. I might''ve had it set up on a tripod, looked through the viewfinder, and then plucked, selectively, the blooms that make it a bit too cluttered. I''d remove the bottom left, and the taller one on the left, as well as the small one below the bloom on the right. Then, to my eye, compositionally, it would be more clean.', '2006-10-26 05:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964353, 414632, 15711, '<td valign="top">The focus on the flower is good. A touch tight on the crop on the right. The bokeh is beautiful but the cool tones of the carnation don''t compliment the warm tones of the background, although I love the huge circular sense of it. It''s like the colors don''t go together, if that makes sense. If the bloom were yellow, or orange - it would be more of a harmonious palette overall (to my eye).</td>', 'The focus on the flower is good. A touch tight on the crop on the right. The bokeh is beautiful but the cool tones of the carnation don''t compliment the warm tones of the background, although I love the huge circular sense of it. It''s like the colors don''t go together, if that makes sense. If the bloom were yellow, or orange - it would be more of a harmonious palette overall (to my eye).', '2006-10-26 05:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964354, 415781, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty cool. And different!! 7</td>', 'That''s pretty cool. And different!! 7', '2006-10-26 05:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964361, 416996, 32161, '<td valign="top">Lovely Bokeh, really nice poses, the only thing I dont like about it is the faces are over exposed, especially the boys,(maybe you wanted it that way). otherwise a very nice shot. good job.</td>', 'Lovely Bokeh, really nice poses, the only thing I dont like about it is the faces are over exposed, especially the boys,(maybe you wanted it that way). otherwise a very nice shot. good job.', '2006-10-26 06:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964362, 416956, 32161, '<td valign="top">He, he, he. v Funny, I did one like this a while back and got hammered for it.... hope you dont.</td>', 'He, he, he. v Funny, I did one like this a while back and got hammered for it.... hope you dont.', '2006-10-26 06:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964364, 415084, 32161, '<td valign="top">The background is wonderful, not enough of the mushroom in focus for me. Graet bokeh and original.</td>', 'The background is wonderful, not enough of the mushroom in focus for me. Graet bokeh and original.', '2006-10-26 06:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964365, 416771, 7743, '<td valign="top">The bokeh is interesting with the repeating patterns however the main subject is blurry and/or moving therefore detracting from the whole image.</td>', 'The bokeh is interesting with the repeating patterns however the main subject is blurry and/or moving therefore detracting from the whole image.', '2006-10-26 06:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964369, 416482, 7743, '<td valign="top">Cool shot though I think it would be better if the horizon were level.</td>', 'Cool shot though I think it would be better if the horizon were level.', '2006-10-26 06:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964372, 415999, 7786, '<td valign="top">Good idea and composition. I would have liked the flower and insect brighter and more easilly visible.</td>', 'Good idea and composition. I would have liked the flower and insect brighter and more easilly visible.', '2006-10-26 06:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964382, 416722, 45818, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! This one hits the challenge spot on. I love how the bokeh is pulled into the foreground by the transparent drops. The only nitpick I have is the grating off-centerness of the drops.</td>', 'Fabulous! This one hits the challenge spot on. I love how the bokeh is pulled into the foreground by the transparent drops. The only nitpick I have is the grating off-centerness of the drops.', '2006-10-26 06:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964383, 415067, 45818, '<td valign="top">Amazing bokeh! Maybe even a bit over the top :-)</td>', 'Amazing bokeh! Maybe even a bit over the top :-)', '2006-10-26 06:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964391, 416210, 61336, '<td valign="top">Don''t care if i''ve seen something like this before. It''s so beautiful and impressive. One of my favs.</td>', 'Don''t care if i''ve seen something like this before. It''s so beautiful and impressive. One of my favs.', '2006-10-26 07:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964392, 416201, 61336, '<td valign="top">Exceptional composition. Got my attention right from the thumb. So calm and strong at the same time. I think we have a winner here.</td>', 'Exceptional composition. Got my attention right from the thumb. So calm and strong at the same time. I think we have a winner here.', '2006-10-26 07:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964393, 416296, 61336, '<td valign="top">Never thought that a dead bug could look so good in a photo.</td>', 'Never thought that a dead bug could look so good in a photo.', '2006-10-26 07:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964394, 416729, 61336, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. The background really enhance your subject.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. The background really enhance your subject.', '2006-10-26 07:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964395, 416765, 61336, '<td valign="top">A lot of flower photos but this one stands out IMHO. I think it would be better to have the whole flower in your frame.</td>', 'A lot of flower photos but this one stands out IMHO. I think it would be better to have the whole flower in your frame.', '2006-10-26 07:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964396, 414656, 61336, '<td valign="top">Nice work.</td>', 'Nice work.', '2006-10-26 07:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964399, 416862, 61336, '<td valign="top">Nice light and colors</td>', 'Nice light and colors', '2006-10-26 07:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964400, 413940, 61336, '<td valign="top">a bit flat light but nice composition</td>', 'a bit flat light but nice composition', '2006-10-26 07:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964420, 416186, 34192, '<td valign="top">As far as bokeh is concerned, this image has it and it works to enhance the subject.  I think the composition is a little lacking though as the image as a whole feels off balance - its almost two images in one frame.  Your DOF is excellent and I like the detail in the subject.  6 - may bump after viewing rest.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'As far as bokeh is concerned, this image has it and it works to enhance the subject.  I think the composition is a little lacking though as the image as a whole feels off balance - its almost two images in one frame.  Your DOF is excellent and I like the detail in the subject.  6 - may bump after viewing rest.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-10-26 07:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964422, 415455, 34192, '<td valign="top">Bokeh in this image is great.  Not sure I like the composition - cutting off the ring doesn''t ''feel'' right.  But your DOF is excellent.  Don''t care for the color cast but that''s a personal choice and not a photographic one. 6 - may bump after viewing others.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Bokeh in this image is great.  Not sure I like the composition - cutting off the ring doesn''t ''feel'' right.  But your DOF is excellent.  Don''t care for the color cast but that''s a personal choice and not a photographic one. 6 - may bump after viewing others.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-10-26 07:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964429, 413761, 3735, '<td valign="top">My only 10 so far ! <br/>Great Job !!</td>', 'My only 10 so far ! Great Job !!', '2006-10-26 07:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964433, 417005, 49109, '<td valign="top">subject is way too dark, bokeh is nice</td>', 'subject is way too dark, bokeh is nice', '2006-10-26 07:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964435, 416437, 34192, '<td valign="top">picture contains bokeh with great color.  I wonder though, at having the ''subject'' be a dirty brown lake bottom.  Hmmm... For me, the subject will be the bokeh itself.  Not really with the ''spirit'' of the challenge but it works for me.  So I''ll call this an interesting abstract that manages to hold my attention waiting for the ripples to clear.</td>', 'picture contains bokeh with great color.  I wonder though, at having the ''subject'' be a dirty brown lake bottom.  Hmmm... For me, the subject will be the bokeh itself.  Not really with the ''spirit'' of the challenge but it works for me.  So I''ll call this an interesting abstract that manages to hold my attention waiting for the ripples to clear.', '2006-10-26 07:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964437, 417025, 49109, '<td valign="top">not much in focus here</td>', 'not much in focus here', '2006-10-26 07:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964466, 414202, 49109, '<td valign="top">crop at top is too tight, the burnt blue part uo left is quite distracting. bokeh is nice</td>', 'crop at top is too tight, the burnt blue part uo left is quite distracting. bokeh is nice', '2006-10-26 08:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964468, 414619, 49109, '<td valign="top">not at all, cause you have no fore- and background</td>', 'not at all, cause you have no fore- and background', '2006-10-26 08:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964476, 414667, 24951, '<td valign="top">Think I would have prefered this image rotated into portrait view.</td>', 'Think I would have prefered this image rotated into portrait view.', '2006-10-26 08:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964480, 416793, 49109, '<td valign="top">one of the Toos? I have seen exactly the same leaf before...</td>', 'one of the Toos? I have seen exactly the same leaf before...', '2006-10-26 08:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964504, 416671, 65592, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo, but i found the foreground disturbing. Cropping a little the botom will make a better result IMO.</td>', 'This is a good photo, but i found the foreground disturbing. Cropping a little the botom will make a better result IMO.', '2006-10-26 09:11:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2964517, 416404, 65592, '<td valign="top">In my opinion you focus so much on showing the background bokeh that you forget about the subject. I think that a good bokeh should enhance the subject, not try to be itself the subject. On the other hand i really like your idea for this challenge.</td>', 'In my opinion you focus so much on showing the background bokeh that you forget about the subject. I think that a good bokeh should enhance the subject, not try to be itself the subject. On the other hand i really like your idea for this challenge.', '2006-10-26 09:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964523, 415736, 52549, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this is a nice image but I wouldn''t call that bokeh in the background.</td>', 'Sorry, this is a nice image but I wouldn''t call that bokeh in the background.', '2006-10-26 09:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964528, 416972, 52549, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the colours here. Just wish that the little girls eye was more in focus.</td>', 'I like the idea and the colours here. Just wish that the little girls eye was more in focus.', '2006-10-26 09:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964530, 416049, 67006, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, but please.....the typo in the title ruins it!</td>', 'Interesting photo, but please.....the typo in the title ruins it!', '2006-10-26 09:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964534, 416996, 52549, '<td valign="top">The sunlight is very harsh on the faces but I love the expression on the little boys face.</td>', 'The sunlight is very harsh on the faces but I love the expression on the little boys face.', '2006-10-26 09:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964536, 415067, 52487, '<td valign="top">Very vivid colors, love the shadows on the back of the leaf.</td>', 'Very vivid colors, love the shadows on the back of the leaf.', '2006-10-26 09:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964538, 415781, 58728, '<td valign="top">Amazing idea.  Executed perfectly.  I love everything about this shot.  :)  10.</td>', 'Amazing idea.  Executed perfectly.  I love everything about this shot.  :)  10.', '2006-10-26 09:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964539, 416401, 58728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I Love it.  Colors, comp, bokeh, it''s all perfect.  10.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I Love it.  Colors, comp, bokeh, it''s all perfect.  10.', '2006-10-26 09:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964540, 415264, 52487, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, the only thing I don''t like is the framing with the thick black bars.</td>', 'Nice capture, the only thing I don''t like is the framing with the thick black bars.', '2006-10-26 09:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964547, 416800, 52487, '<td valign="top">Great expression on her face, really captured her emotion.</td>', 'Great expression on her face, really captured her emotion.', '2006-10-26 09:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964551, 416981, 52549, '<td valign="top">The bokeh''s wonderful but I''m not keen on the bottle as a main subject. The left hand side of the bottle looks very scratched and imperfect. I also feel that with the bottle been so predominant, not enough of the bokeh can be seen. However, your image meets the challenge and the lighting''s good.</td>', 'The bokeh''s wonderful but I''m not keen on the bottle as a main subject. The left hand side of the bottle looks very scratched and imperfect. I also feel that with the bottle been so predominant, not enough of the bokeh can be seen. However, your image meets the challenge and the lighting''s good.', '2006-10-26 09:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964552, 416210, 58728, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!!!!!  I''m guessing you might be Ursula??   :)  i love this shot.  It''s beautiful.  10 from me!</td>', 'Gorgeous!!!!!  I''m guessing you might be Ursula??   :)  i love this shot.  It''s beautiful.  10 from me!', '2006-10-26 09:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964553, 417026, 52549, '<td valign="top">This works very well in b/w. Good luck with it.</td>', 'This works very well in b/w. Good luck with it.', '2006-10-26 09:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964561, 415067, 58728, '<td valign="top">BEautiful.  I Love the glow of the red leaf.  Great colors and perfect bokeh.  :)</td>', 'BEautiful.  I Love the glow of the red leaf.  Great colors and perfect bokeh.  :)', '2006-10-26 09:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964563, 415900, 23430, '<td valign="top">Impressive flames</td>', 'Impressive flames', '2006-10-26 09:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964567, 416599, 52549, '<td valign="top">Sorry, don''t see any bokeh here - just an out of focus hand.</td>', 'Sorry, don''t see any bokeh here - just an out of focus hand.', '2006-10-26 09:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964572, 415970, 23430, '<td valign="top">Not way excited about the foreground but it''s one of the best bokehs I have seen in this challenge.</td>', 'Not way excited about the foreground but it''s one of the best bokehs I have seen in this challenge.', '2006-10-26 09:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964577, 413737, 67152, '<td valign="top">The entire image appears out of focus.</td>', 'The entire image appears out of focus.', '2006-10-26 09:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964578, 416474, 67152, '<td valign="top">The bokeh is not very interesting</td>', 'The bokeh is not very interesting', '2006-10-26 09:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964630, 414682, 32869, '<td valign="top">I like what this image represents.  It would make a very good stock Ad shot.  Also I would give just a little more definition to the feline in the background still keeping the focus on the mouse.</td>', 'I like what this image represents.  It would make a very good stock Ad shot.  Also I would give just a little more definition to the feline in the background still keeping the focus on the mouse.', '2006-10-26 10:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964723, 414822, 49109, '<td valign="top">very nice bokeh and color, interesting subject - had given it a 9, but will not vote ''cause you had already posted it in the forums</td>', 'very nice bokeh and color, interesting subject - had given it a 9, but will not vote ''cause you had already posted it in the forums', '2006-10-26 10:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964734, 416517, 15711, '<td valign="top">A classic. The detail in the drop always amazes me. Nature''s reflective magnifying glass. Maybe not totally unusual but certainly rich tones and suits the challenge well. I like the criss crossing of the blades of grass.</td>', 'A classic. The detail in the drop always amazes me. Nature''s reflective magnifying glass. Maybe not totally unusual but certainly rich tones and suits the challenge well. I like the criss crossing of the blades of grass.', '2006-10-26 10:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964737, 415439, 67395, '<td valign="top">I like the line this photo creates.</td>', 'I like the line this photo creates.', '2006-10-26 10:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964740, 416774, 65779, '<td valign="top">This would be great had the subject been in focus.  An attractive pic though...</td>', 'This would be great had the subject been in focus.  An attractive pic though...', '2006-10-26 10:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964741, 415357, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this one.  I think what I''d love to see is some richer tones.  I would play with curves and levels adjustments to enrich the overall colors to really give it the pop it deserves.</td>', 'I like the idea of this one.  I think what I''d love to see is some richer tones.  I would play with curves and levels adjustments to enrich the overall colors to really give it the pop it deserves.', '2006-10-26 10:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964742, 416450, 15711, '<td valign="top">Black and white can work in this situation, but I''m craving the red of the berries and green of the leaves in this one.  The lighting seems a touch harsh.  I would probably run it through Neat image to smooth out the graininess of the background.</td>', 'Black and white can work in this situation, but I''m craving the red of the berries and green of the leaves in this one.  The lighting seems a touch harsh.  I would probably run it through Neat image to smooth out the graininess of the background.', '2006-10-26 10:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964745, 416268, 65779, '<td valign="top">Not really bokeh</td>', 'Not really bokeh', '2006-10-26 10:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964747, 416119, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting almost abstract take on it.  The grass behind the vine adds a nice texture without making it too busy.</td>', 'Interesting almost abstract take on it.  The grass behind the vine adds a nice texture without making it too busy.', '2006-10-26 10:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964749, 416829, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this several times without commenting.  I think I want to see more negative space around this guy. The focus is good and the rich blues are lovely.</td>', 'I''ve come back to this several times without commenting.  I think I want to see more negative space around this guy. The focus is good and the rich blues are lovely.', '2006-10-26 10:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964750, 416306, 65779, '<td valign="top">Very nice one-legged gull.  I know I know... They hold their legs up.</td>', 'Very nice one-legged gull.  I know I know... They hold their legs up.', '2006-10-26 11:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964754, 416203, 65779, '<td valign="top">No background is visible therefore no bokeh.</td>', 'No background is visible therefore no bokeh.', '2006-10-26 11:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964755, 415232, 15711, '<td valign="top">Now if you can play "Stardust" on a classical guitar... that''s something. I like the overall warm tones of the image. Looking up the neck of a guitar isn''t anything new or innovative, but the overall appeal is there with the light glinting off of the first three strings. The bottom fret (?) is a touch distracting.</td>', 'Now if you can play "Stardust" on a classical guitar... that''s something. I like the overall warm tones of the image. Looking up the neck of a guitar isn''t anything new or innovative, but the overall appeal is there with the light glinting off of the first three strings. The bottom fret (?) is a touch distracting.', '2006-10-26 11:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964759, 416139, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this several times and keep coming back. It has a soft wispy sense to it yet I feel as if I''m missing something. I can''t quite put my finger on it. Maybe in the landscape orientation with more negative space.  I''m not sure. Maybe I''d like to see more contrast on the fronds. I do like the bluish green and peachy tones of the background, which certainly suit the challenge. It just doesn''t have the POW I''d like to see.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this several times and keep coming back. It has a soft wispy sense to it yet I feel as if I''m missing something. I can''t quite put my finger on it. Maybe in the landscape orientation with more negative space.  I''m not sure. Maybe I''d like to see more contrast on the fronds. I do like the bluish green and peachy tones of the background, which certainly suit the challenge. It just doesn''t have the POW I''d like to see.', '2006-10-26 11:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964761, 414682, 49109, '<td valign="top">see the cat, got the joke, but miss a good bokeh. think the distance between mouse and cat is too large, a shot from a lower angle with a slightly smaller aperture had probably been better. 5 for creativity</td>', 'see the cat, got the joke, but miss a good bokeh. think the distance between mouse and cat is too large, a shot from a lower angle with a slightly smaller aperture had probably been better. 5 for creativity', '2006-10-26 11:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964764, 416220, 65779, '<td valign="top">Background is too even for good bokeh. Lovely shot though but didn''t need the water drops.</td>', 'Background is too even for good bokeh. Lovely shot though but didn''t need the water drops.', '2006-10-26 11:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964765, 416496, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cool title.  Nice detailing on the leaf. Not overly unique, but the texture and color variance on the leaf is good. This has a nice simplicity, which many of the natural ones in this challenge do not.</td>', 'Cool title.  Nice detailing on the leaf. Not overly unique, but the texture and color variance on the leaf is good. This has a nice simplicity, which many of the natural ones in this challenge do not.', '2006-10-26 11:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
