(2964923, 416960, 53147, '<td valign="top">Hmmm - Feels like you took a box of crayons and set it up against a monitor screen. The crayons colors seem flat and too bright compared to the background and the shadow or blur behind them is not nice. To be honest the two parts of the pciture (front and back) just dont seem to have anything in common or anything to connect them. Maybe if you had a background that had more of the colors of the crayons it could have helped.</td>', 'Hmmm - Feels like you took a box of crayons and set it up against a monitor screen. The crayons colors seem flat and too bright compared to the background and the shadow or blur behind them is not nice. To be honest the two parts of the pciture (front and back) just dont seem to have anything in common or anything to connect them. Maybe if you had a background that had more of the colors of the crayons it could have helped.', '2006-10-26 12:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964926, 416843, 53147, '<td valign="top">Dang butterflies. They are just strong in this challenge. Great detail on the bug and the background color is a nice contrast. I think your background patterns add well to the forefront image. Nice capture.</td>', 'Dang butterflies. They are just strong in this challenge. Great detail on the bug and the background color is a nice contrast. I think your background patterns add well to the forefront image. Nice capture.', '2006-10-26 12:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
