(2964934, 417032, 53147, '<td valign="top">A bit too much of a snap shot feel to this. Nice colors on the flower but the composition in general is lacking.</td>', 'A bit too much of a snap shot feel to this. Nice colors on the flower but the composition in general is lacking.', '2006-10-26 12:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
