(2964939, 416280, 53147, '<td valign="top">Cool image. The background becomes the primary aspect and the silhouette is a nice balance. Outside of the two spots of light on the face this is a pretty clean image. Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Cool image. The background becomes the primary aspect and the silhouette is a nice balance. Outside of the two spots of light on the face this is a pretty clean image. Nice take on the challenge.', '2006-10-26 12:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
