(2964942, 414600, 53147, '<td valign="top">Maye a bit too simple for the challenge. Nice colors and all but lacking any real WOW power.</td>', 'Maye a bit too simple for the challenge. Nice colors and all but lacking any real WOW power.', '2006-10-26 12:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964943, 415081, 18868, '<td valign="top">Nice capture on technique -- well exposed for highlights, appropriate apeture for bokeh, but compositionally, it''s not very engaging.  Perhaps a "spotlight" on the foreground jack could create more drama in the image.</td>', 'Nice capture on technique -- well exposed for highlights, appropriate apeture for bokeh, but compositionally, it''s not very engaging.  Perhaps a "spotlight" on the foreground jack could create more drama in the image.', '2006-10-26 12:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964947, 416968, 53147, '<td valign="top">One of the better animal images. Had the title not been there the image would not have as much kick to it. It just wouldnt have made much sense. Would the bokeh here be called "barkeh"? That was bad huh. Decent image kicked up a point by the title.</td>', 'One of the better animal images. Had the title not been there the image would not have as much kick to it. It just wouldnt have made much sense. Would the bokeh here be called "barkeh"? That was bad huh. Decent image kicked up a point by the title.', '2006-10-26 12:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964949, 416509, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice. Great eyes and great clarity on the girl. I am not so sure if the background really adds a whole lot to the image but it surely doesnt take away from it.</td>', 'Nice. Great eyes and great clarity on the girl. I am not so sure if the background really adds a whole lot to the image but it surely doesnt take away from it.', '2006-10-26 12:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964953, 416972, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice - excellent use of foreground bokeh. I really like the varying degrees of blur thorugh out the picture that lead right back to the girl. Great timing.</td>', 'Nice - excellent use of foreground bokeh. I really like the varying degrees of blur thorugh out the picture that lead right back to the girl. Great timing.', '2006-10-26 12:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964954, 414928, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful gold and greens. The stop action of the moth is really good too. If I were to change anything, I might crop out that touch of another flower at the top. I think there is enough of the blur behind the larger subject flower, to work without it at the top. Rich and lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful gold and greens. The stop action of the moth is really good too. If I were to change anything, I might crop out that touch of another flower at the top. I think there is enough of the blur behind the larger subject flower, to work without it at the top. Rich and lovely.', '2006-10-26 12:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964956, 414619, 53147, '<td valign="top">I realize that this is within the DPC rule set but these type shots just dont impress me. I get the irony and all but as an image it does very little.</td>', 'I realize that this is within the DPC rule set but these type shots just dont impress me. I get the irony and all but as an image it does very little.', '2006-10-26 12:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964957, 416925, 53147, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark overall and there really doesnt seem to be a main point of interest.</td>', 'A bit too dark overall and there really doesnt seem to be a main point of interest.', '2006-10-26 12:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964958, 413507, 53147, '<td valign="top">Sharp image. great detail and clarity on the fly and the patterns in the background add a pleasant element ot the image without being overpowering. Nice work.</td>', 'Sharp image. great detail and clarity on the fly and the patterns in the background add a pleasant element ot the image without being overpowering. Nice work.', '2006-10-26 12:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964963, 414282, 53147, '<td valign="top">I opened this one up earlier when browsing through before voting and I was pleased that it was as cool as I had hoped from thumbnail. Great detail and excellent DOF. The mantis color is a great contrast the rest of the image and the background and foreground blur really add well. On eof my top picks of the challenge so far. Its too cold where I live for these guys to be hanging out anymore - I am jealous.</td>', 'I opened this one up earlier when browsing through before voting and I was pleased that it was as cool as I had hoped from thumbnail. Great detail and excellent DOF. The mantis color is a great contrast the rest of the image and the background and foreground blur really add well. On eof my top picks of the challenge so far. Its too cold where I live for these guys to be hanging out anymore - I am jealous.', '2006-10-26 12:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964966, 414731, 53147, '<td valign="top">Well you have bokeh going on but it really doesnt seem to add a whole lot to the image. You rforeground "model" is lacking in detail and general interest. The colors and lighting overall just seem to bright to really bring out any strong detail. Feels like a rushed snapshot.</td>', 'Well you have bokeh going on but it really doesnt seem to add a whole lot to the image. You rforeground "model" is lacking in detail and general interest. The colors and lighting overall just seem to bright to really bring out any strong detail. Feels like a rushed snapshot.', '2006-10-26 12:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964968, 415044, 53147, '<td valign="top">I like this. Great autumn colors, nice clarity on your front subjects and the blurred background adds nice lines, curves and colors without being overpowering. To me this is a very pleasing image all the way around.</td>', 'I like this. Great autumn colors, nice clarity on your front subjects and the blurred background adds nice lines, curves and colors without being overpowering. To me this is a very pleasing image all the way around.', '2006-10-26 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964976, 416437, 18868, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but I wouldn''t call it bokeh -- the reflections are accurately rendered, but distored, not out of the focal plane.</td>', 'Beautiful, but I wouldn''t call it bokeh -- the reflections are accurately rendered, but distored, not out of the focal plane.', '2006-10-26 12:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2964993, 416438, 18868, '<td valign="top">All bokeh means "OOF".  It needs a foreground subject to work.  Neat capture, tho.</td>', 'All bokeh means "OOF".  It needs a foreground subject to work.  Neat capture, tho.', '2006-10-26 13:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965025, 416141, 18868, '<td valign="top">Great title.  It might be more dramatic with a little more contrast/darker shadows.  Don''t be afraid of the dark.  :)</td>', 'Great title.  It might be more dramatic with a little more contrast/darker shadows.  Don''t be afraid of the dark.  :)', '2006-10-26 13:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
