(2965218, 416828, 53147, '<td valign="top">Pretty intense bokeh going on here. Maybe a bit too much as it is stealing away from your front leaf. The area of the background that I find most pleasing is the lower half. It seems that that area compliments the leaf well. The upper part is just too intense IMO.</td>', 'Pretty intense bokeh going on here. Maybe a bit too much as it is stealing away from your front leaf. The area of the background that I find most pleasing is the lower half. It seems that that area compliments the leaf well. The upper part is just too intense IMO.', '2006-10-26 14:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965226, 414648, 53147, '<td valign="top">Not really sure if this counts as bokeh but I guess the blurry part does have impact the image. I get the message of the pic but the image just doesnt seem like a strong picture to me.</td>', 'Not really sure if this counts as bokeh but I guess the blurry part does have impact the image. I get the message of the pic but the image just doesnt seem like a strong picture to me.', '2006-10-26 14:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965230, 415731, 53147, '<td valign="top">Well the blurry background is the interestin gpart in this shot for sure. I am just not really sure how the in focus forefront really compliments the zebra. THey just feel like two independent items placed together for no reason.</td>', 'Well the blurry background is the interestin gpart in this shot for sure. I am just not really sure how the in focus forefront really compliments the zebra. THey just feel like two independent items placed together for no reason.', '2006-10-26 14:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965232, 415357, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple. Good focus, color and lighting onthe forefront and the bokeh does compliment the front well. A pleasant picture overall but maybe lacking some of the WOW that other shots have captured.</td>', 'Nice and simple. Good focus, color and lighting onthe forefront and the bokeh does compliment the front well. A pleasant picture overall but maybe lacking some of the WOW that other shots have captured.', '2006-10-26 14:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965254, 413435, 64175, '<td valign="top">You have a very nice shot here. Not sure if it is sepia or what exactly to call the color tone other than ''aged'', but that enhances this photo.  This might be a nice challenge for the Free Study this month, but unfortunately, it does not meet the challenge in my opinion for Bokeh.  The depth of focus is deep so the child in front and back are both clearly in focus.  The background too, thus there is no "soft blurring in the out of focus area to enhance the photo".  Sorry, this is a DNMC entry IMO.</td>', 'You have a very nice shot here. Not sure if it is sepia or what exactly to call the color tone other than ''aged'', but that enhances this photo.  This might be a nice challenge for the Free Study this month, but unfortunately, it does not meet the challenge in my opinion for Bokeh.  The depth of focus is deep so the child in front and back are both clearly in focus.  The background too, thus there is no "soft blurring in the out of focus area to enhance the photo".  Sorry, this is a DNMC entry IMO.', '2006-10-26 14:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2965262, 416925, 53018, '<td valign="top">Love it !!!</td>', 'Love it !!!', '2006-10-26 14:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
