(2965873, 416885, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice smooth bokeh, surrounds pansy nicely. You might consider off setting the position of the pansy and applying more sharpening.<br/> <br/>I don''t vote down an image because of its border, but do find it to be a distraction in this composition. Works, though, if you are an Oregon State University or Oklahoma State University fan.</td>', 'Nice smooth bokeh, surrounds pansy nicely. You might consider off setting the position of the pansy and applying more sharpening. I don''t vote down an image because of its border, but do find it to be a distraction in this composition. Works, though, if you are an Oregon State University or Oklahoma State University fan.', '2006-10-26 18:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
