(2965953, 416217, 31829, '<td valign="top">Perhaps viewing a larger image would show some form of BOKEH here, but I don''t see it by viewing it here.<br/> <br/>Great image though.  If I were to go looking for a portrait location, I''d love to have this spot.  Try a wider aperture next time as the background may be a bit too much in focus for a portrait.</td>', 'Perhaps viewing a larger image would show some form of BOKEH here, but I don''t see it by viewing it here. Great image though.  If I were to go looking for a portrait location, I''d love to have this spot.  Try a wider aperture next time as the background may be a bit too much in focus for a portrait.', '2006-10-26 19:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
