(2966631, 416750, 30982, '<td valign="top">An extra point for making me laugh - I needed that!</td>', 'An extra point for making me laugh - I needed that!', '2006-10-26 23:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966644, 416913, 53147, '<td valign="top">Quite the image but from a challenge standpoint I am not quite sure if I see how this fits. I dont know if the mountain would be considered bokeh as it seems pretty infoucs considering the surroundings. From a general picture POV leveling out the horizon would help a bit. Tweaking the curves or levels to bring out more contrast in the shadows and maybe a slight tweak in saturation could be a plus.</td>', 'Quite the image but from a challenge standpoint I am not quite sure if I see how this fits. I dont know if the mountain would be considered bokeh as it seems pretty infoucs considering the surroundings. From a general picture POV leveling out the horizon would help a bit. Tweaking the curves or levels to bring out more contrast in the shadows and maybe a slight tweak in saturation could be a plus.', '2006-10-26 23:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966654, 416367, 53147, '<td valign="top">I figure this isnt the intention but this shot says to me "Ouch I just got stung by a bee - wanna see?" But seriously - good clean image and you have the bokeh thin ggoing on but I am not really sure if it adds a whole lot to the image. It doesnt take away from it though so thats a good thing.</td>', 'I figure this isnt the intention but this shot says to me "Ouch I just got stung by a bee - wanna see?" But seriously - good clean image and you have the bokeh thin ggoing on but I am not really sure if it adds a whole lot to the image. It doesnt take away from it though so thats a good thing.', '2006-10-26 23:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966668, 416849, 53147, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too much going on in this shot IMO. There doesnt seem to be a good separation between the front and back blur and the area in focus. Has a messy feel and whatever bokeh there may be really doesnt stand out or help in any way.</td>', 'Just a bit too much going on in this shot IMO. There doesnt seem to be a good separation between the front and back blur and the area in focus. Has a messy feel and whatever bokeh there may be really doesnt stand out or help in any way.', '2006-10-26 23:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966679, 416285, 53147, '<td valign="top">Well you have the little light circles working. Good crisp foreground image. This has a slight feel of a drink add and I guess the bokeh aspect would just be some artistic flair to it. Clean shot and fits the challenge well but doesnt really leave me feeling anything in particular good or bad.</td>', 'Well you have the little light circles working. Good crisp foreground image. This has a slight feel of a drink add and I guess the bokeh aspect would just be some artistic flair to it. Clean shot and fits the challenge well but doesnt really leave me feeling anything in particular good or bad.', '2006-10-26 23:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966681, 416725, 53147, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for a clean cat shot. Great clarity and detail on kitty and the blurred background lines and patterns offer a good contrast to the curves of kitty. A pleasant shot overall but maybe lacking some of the serious WOW power of other entries.</td>', 'I am a sucker for a clean cat shot. Great clarity and detail on kitty and the blurred background lines and patterns offer a good contrast to the curves of kitty. A pleasant shot overall but maybe lacking some of the serious WOW power of other entries.', '2006-10-26 23:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966686, 416536, 53147, '<td valign="top">I found that shooting these guys is quite nice as they will just sit there in the water and not move for quite a while. Good color and clarity on fishy and the blurred background works well to complete the shot. You even scored a couple light circles. Nice shot overall but maybe lacking some of the WOW power of other entries.</td>', 'I found that shooting these guys is quite nice as they will just sit there in the water and not move for quite a while. Good color and clarity on fishy and the blurred background works well to complete the shot. You even scored a couple light circles. Nice shot overall but maybe lacking some of the WOW power of other entries.', '2006-10-26 23:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966705, 416685, 53147, '<td valign="top">Those arent Smarties. At least not in America. Nice lines and patterns inthe background that really pull this image. The two up front seem a bit soft and the shadows arent the greatest. The colors dont feel as vibrant as they might have been which could have offered more bang. Ditching that far left line and replacing it with the red from the right may have been nice as well. A shame to hide that color off to the side.</td>', 'Those arent Smarties. At least not in America. Nice lines and patterns inthe background that really pull this image. The two up front seem a bit soft and the shadows arent the greatest. The colors dont feel as vibrant as they might have been which could have offered more bang. Ditching that far left line and replacing it with the red from the right may have been nice as well. A shame to hide that color off to the side.', '2006-10-26 23:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966712, 416266, 53147, '<td valign="top">Well - this one has me stumped. I am not quite sure what to say. I think your title says it all.</td>', 'Well - this one has me stumped. I am not quite sure what to say. I think your title says it all.', '2006-10-26 23:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966719, 416922, 53147, '<td valign="top">This shot is cool and different. The green colors and rust are a great compliment. A touch of foreground blur and the deepening blur going back really enhance the image well. Has a funky abstract kind of feel to it even though you can tell its a piece of machinery. Good eye and nice capture.</td>', 'This shot is cool and different. The green colors and rust are a great compliment. A touch of foreground blur and the deepening blur going back really enhance the image well. Has a funky abstract kind of feel to it even though you can tell its a piece of machinery. Good eye and nice capture.', '2006-10-26 23:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966721, 416839, 24951, '<td valign="top">Have you experimented with using back and white or duotones on theis image?</td>', 'Have you experimented with using back and white or duotones on theis image?', '2006-10-26 23:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966727, 415234, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great colors, nice detail ont he forefront, cool patterns and the varying degrees of blur headed back surely add to the impact of the image. This has a feel of an Elsapo image. Very nice work.</td>', 'Great colors, nice detail ont he forefront, cool patterns and the varying degrees of blur headed back surely add to the impact of the image. This has a feel of an Elsapo image. Very nice work.', '2006-10-26 23:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966828, 417027, 39702, '<td valign="top">The OOF area dominates the photo rather than enhancing the focal point of the subject; the stem. Pleasing colors though.</td>', 'The OOF area dominates the photo rather than enhancing the focal point of the subject; the stem. Pleasing colors though.', '2006-10-27 00:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966840, 413435, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love his expression.  Not really seeing enough blur to really consider it bokeh.</td>', 'I love his expression.  Not really seeing enough blur to really consider it bokeh.', '2006-10-27 00:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966843, 415676, 39702, '<td valign="top">The OOF portion of the photo is a bit busy; too many small points of differing colors. I think this detracts from rather than enhances the focal point.</td>', 'The OOF portion of the photo is a bit busy; too many small points of differing colors. I think this detracts from rather than enhances the focal point.', '2006-10-27 00:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
