(2966987, 413561, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, the sparkles on the water really enhance it, as does the gentle cloud shape in the distance (or is that a mountain range int  he distance?).  ~9</td>', 'Beautiful image, the sparkles on the water really enhance it, as does the gentle cloud shape in the distance (or is that a mountain range int  he distance?).  ~9', '2006-10-27 01:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966989, 415781, 32872, '<td valign="top">Innovative idea!</td>', 'Innovative idea!', '2006-10-27 01:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966990, 416839, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bokeh!  Tells the story here.  Good light control.</td>', 'Beautiful bokeh!  Tells the story here.  Good light control.', '2006-10-27 01:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966992, 415702, 5112, '<td valign="top">The blues are very beautiful in this image.  The butterfly is just the right sharpness.  It''s lovely.</td>', 'The blues are very beautiful in this image.  The butterfly is just the right sharpness.  It''s lovely.', '2006-10-27 01:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966993, 415199, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like it how the colours of the eye are repeated in the background.  The background enhances the cat here, nice!</td>', 'I like it how the colours of the eye are repeated in the background.  The background enhances the cat here, nice!', '2006-10-27 01:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966995, 415510, 5112, '<td valign="top">Excellent bokeh!  Lovely butterfly picture.  The light is so good here.  ~9</td>', 'Excellent bokeh!  Lovely butterfly picture.  The light is so good here.  ~9', '2006-10-27 01:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966996, 416833, 32872, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhh,,,sweet photo.  I love birds,,,nice ''bokeh'', too!</td>', 'Ahhhhh,,,sweet photo.  I love birds,,,nice ''bokeh'', too!', '2006-10-27 01:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2966997, 415663, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good catch!  Love the expression, goes perfect with the way the hands are on the instrument.</td>', 'Good catch!  Love the expression, goes perfect with the way the hands are on the instrument.', '2006-10-27 01:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967002, 415080, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  The bokeh really enhances the image in this situation, gives it that extra sparkle.  It''s neat how that sparkle is repeated in the little bright spot on the teeth.  ~9</td>', 'Beautiful!  The bokeh really enhances the image in this situation, gives it that extra sparkle.  It''s neat how that sparkle is repeated in the little bright spot on the teeth.  ~9', '2006-10-27 01:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967004, 414896, 5112, '<td valign="top">I love the little row of palm trees in the reflection!</td>', 'I love the little row of palm trees in the reflection!', '2006-10-27 01:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967007, 415357, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bokeh.  Lovely shape to the branch and leaves.</td>', 'Beautiful bokeh.  Lovely shape to the branch and leaves.', '2006-10-27 01:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967008, 416284, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like how part of the out of focus candles (is it candles?) looks like a heart.  Nice setup.</td>', 'I like how part of the out of focus candles (is it candles?) looks like a heart.  Nice setup.', '2006-10-27 01:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967010, 416752, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this!  I can hear the song looking at this.  Daring entry :)</td>', 'I like this!  I can hear the song looking at this.  Daring entry :)', '2006-10-27 01:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967014, 416401, 5112, '<td valign="top">How''d you do this?  Is that an actual scene, or a picture?  Very interesting.  Looks almost like a cartoon.  I like it.</td>', 'How''d you do this?  Is that an actual scene, or a picture?  Very interesting.  Looks almost like a cartoon.  I like it.', '2006-10-27 01:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967017, 415234, 5112, '<td valign="top">Oh, wow!  This is excellent, really really excellent.  I''m going out tomorrow morning and finding ferns to practice on something like this.  I hope you ribbon.  ~10</td>', 'Oh, wow!  This is excellent, really really excellent.  I''m going out tomorrow morning and finding ferns to practice on something like this.  I hope you ribbon.  ~10', '2006-10-27 01:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967020, 415270, 5112, '<td valign="top">The bokeh makes it look like she has a flower in her hair, makes it beautiful.  Very nice.  ~9</td>', 'The bokeh makes it look like she has a flower in her hair, makes it beautiful.  Very nice.  ~9', '2006-10-27 01:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967022, 416438, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, and the looks.  I''m not sure it gives the impression of "blowing  in the wind" all that much, as the flowers look rather static, like they''re not really moving.</td>', 'I like the concept, and the looks.  I''m not sure it gives the impression of "blowing  in the wind" all that much, as the flowers look rather static, like they''re not really moving.', '2006-10-27 01:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
