(2967047, 416267, 5112, '<td valign="top">The eye is so perfectly clear.  Love the blue rim at the bottom of the eye, and the lashes.  Giraffe is the name?  Love how it fades to the background, the blurred rump complements the sharp eye just right.  ~9</td>', 'The eye is so perfectly clear.  Love the blue rim at the bottom of the eye, and the lashes.  Giraffe is the name?  Love how it fades to the background, the blurred rump complements the sharp eye just right.  ~9', '2006-10-27 01:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967049, 416509, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful candid.  Her eyes are special, so big.  Love the way she''s holding up one finger.  Bokeh is not really prominent in this image, but it does enhance the feel of it nicely.  ~8</td>', 'Beautiful candid.  Her eyes are special, so big.  Love the way she''s holding up one finger.  Bokeh is not really prominent in this image, but it does enhance the feel of it nicely.  ~8', '2006-10-27 01:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967052, 416532, 5112, '<td valign="top">The butterfly looks like she''s at an amusement park, on one of those rides that goes up and down - actually she looks like she''s thinking about going on a ride.  I like it.  As for the challenge, the bokeh enhances the subject nicely here.  Good work.  ~8</td>', 'The butterfly looks like she''s at an amusement park, on one of those rides that goes up and down - actually she looks like she''s thinking about going on a ride.  I like it.  As for the challenge, the bokeh enhances the subject nicely here.  Good work.  ~8', '2006-10-27 01:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967053, 416765, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft "bokeh" in this image.</td>', 'Beautiful soft "bokeh" in this image.', '2006-10-27 01:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967056, 414604, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow!   Now that is some beautiful bokeh!  This image is almost only bokeh.  It really enhances the rose hip.  Nice!  ~9</td>', 'Wow!   Now that is some beautiful bokeh!  This image is almost only bokeh.  It really enhances the rose hip.  Nice!  ~9', '2006-10-27 01:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967057, 415816, 5112, '<td valign="top">How in the world did you get that flower so beautiful and clear and sharp throughout, and still get that wonderful bokeh in the background?  Flash?  Love the complementary colours.  Good work!  ~10</td>', 'How in the world did you get that flower so beautiful and clear and sharp throughout, and still get that wonderful bokeh in the background?  Flash?  Love the complementary colours.  Good work!  ~10', '2006-10-27 01:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967060, 416493, 5112, '<td valign="top">Oh, wow, I''d give this 11 if there were an 11.  It is beautiful!  The colours are like those of a classic painting, the composition is just right, the bokeh really works to enhance the subject, the expression is darling.  ~10</td>', 'Oh, wow, I''d give this 11 if there were an 11.  It is beautiful!  The colours are like those of a classic painting, the composition is just right, the bokeh really works to enhance the subject, the expression is darling.  ~10', '2006-10-27 01:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
