(2967336, 414632, 34192, '<td valign="top">The Bokeh here is nice.  However, for me, it doesn''t match the subject.  I think it is the colors that seem to fight against each other - the warm, earthy tones of the background just don''t seem to work with the cool, electric color of the flower.  The image is cropped tightly on the right, a little too tightly, to justify all the space on the left.  The subject is perfectly sharp and the lighting of the subject is well done.</td>', 'The Bokeh here is nice.  However, for me, it doesn''t match the subject.  I think it is the colors that seem to fight against each other - the warm, earthy tones of the background just don''t seem to work with the cool, electric color of the flower.  The image is cropped tightly on the right, a little too tightly, to justify all the space on the left.  The subject is perfectly sharp and the lighting of the subject is well done.', '2006-10-27 07:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967344, 416476, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This one is cropped perfectly for an optical illusion.  Took me a ocuple of seconds to separate the leaf from the background.  Interesting.  Atisticaly this doesn''t hold my attention - there is no emotional impact for me beyond the first couple seconds.  But, conceptually this image really works; I''ll concider it an abstract. 7 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Wow.  This one is cropped perfectly for an optical illusion.  Took me a ocuple of seconds to separate the leaf from the background.  Interesting.  Atisticaly this doesn''t hold my attention - there is no emotional impact for me beyond the first couple seconds.  But, conceptually this image really works; I''ll concider it an abstract. 7 - good luck in the challenge!', '2006-10-27 07:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967347, 414348, 34192, '<td valign="top">There''s not a lot of detail in the out of focus area to create really good bokeh.  But there is some.  I like the way the subject looks like its bowing.  Emotive piece, not sure if I want the horizon in it or not.  Last thoughts:  For a bokeh challenge, not all that strong but for me, works on emotional level.</td>', 'There''s not a lot of detail in the out of focus area to create really good bokeh.  But there is some.  I like the way the subject looks like its bowing.  Emotive piece, not sure if I want the horizon in it or not.  Last thoughts:  For a bokeh challenge, not all that strong but for me, works on emotional level.', '2006-10-27 07:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967349, 416119, 34192, '<td valign="top">this works for me but I''m partial to monochromes/duotones.  Focus is well done, composition excellent.</td>', 'this works for me but I''m partial to monochromes/duotones.  Focus is well done, composition excellent.', '2006-10-27 07:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967351, 416002, 34192, '<td valign="top">rhis is so in-your-face centered I can''t decide if I like it or not.  On the one hand, the image feels static; on the other, it gives the flower a defiant air as if its conscious of itself.  Something to contemplate.  The bokeh works for me - it does make the subject stand out.</td>', 'rhis is so in-your-face centered I can''t decide if I like it or not.  On the one hand, the image feels static; on the other, it gives the flower a defiant air as if its conscious of itself.  Something to contemplate.  The bokeh works for me - it does make the subject stand out.', '2006-10-27 07:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967358, 415997, 49643, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but looks little bit oversharp</td>', 'Nice shot but looks little bit oversharp', '2006-10-27 07:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967361, 416793, 49643, '<td valign="top">Very Nice..</td>', 'Very Nice..', '2006-10-27 07:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967365, 415234, 49643, '<td valign="top">Very beatuiful,congratulations....<br/>Well you deserve it I already wished you..<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-01 04:58:09.</i></td>', 'Very beatuiful,congratulations....Well you deserve it I already wished you..', '2006-10-27 07:40:30.000000', '2006-11-01 04:58:09.000000', 1),
(2967369, 416819, 49643, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. But I think some petals are missing if they were not missing &amp; if you have used rule of third this image may have become more interesting..</td>', 'Nice colours. But I think some petals are missing if they were not missing & if you have used rule of third this image may have become more interesting..', '2006-10-27 07:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967375, 416992, 49643, '<td valign="top">Nice image but somewhat underexposed &amp; a little bit out of focus</td>', 'Nice image but somewhat underexposed & a little bit out of focus', '2006-10-27 07:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967377, 416986, 49643, '<td valign="top">A very good berry photo until I have seen in this contest.</td>', 'A very good berry photo until I have seen in this contest.', '2006-10-27 07:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967409, 416210, 53147, '<td valign="top">Well this is just lovely. Beautiful soft colors, excellent patterns, great detail on the strip in the middle and both the blurred foreground and background just really help make the shot complete wihtout being overpowering or silly. This feels like an Ursula shot all the way. Excellent work and bumping up 1 for now. I will probably be back again to top it off.</td>', 'Well this is just lovely. Beautiful soft colors, excellent patterns, great detail on the strip in the middle and both the blurred foreground and background just really help make the shot complete wihtout being overpowering or silly. This feels like an Ursula shot all the way. Excellent work and bumping up 1 for now. I will probably be back again to top it off.', '2006-10-27 08:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967410, 416662, 53147, '<td valign="top">This is nice. While maybe not bokeh in a traditional sense or how most people want it I like it alot.  Nice DOF on the spider and the nice soft blend of colors and loose patterns in the blurred background really compliment him well. Very nice capture. Bumping up 1.</td>', 'This is nice. While maybe not bokeh in a traditional sense or how most people want it I like it alot.  Nice DOF on the spider and the nice soft blend of colors and loose patterns in the blurred background really compliment him well. Very nice capture. Bumping up 1.', '2006-10-27 08:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967413, 416201, 53147, '<td valign="top">White beauty is dead on. This is lovely. Great detail and clarity on the front flower andthe soft blurred background really completes/compliments the image well. A far cry from so many of the flower shots that feel like they were placed somewhere just for the bokeh effect without any other purpose. Lovely lines and colors. One of my top picks of the challenge. Bumping up to a 9 for now. I will most likely be back to finish this one off.</td>', 'White beauty is dead on. This is lovely. Great detail and clarity on the front flower andthe soft blurred background really completes/compliments the image well. A far cry from so many of the flower shots that feel like they were placed somewhere just for the bokeh effect without any other purpose. Lovely lines and colors. One of my top picks of the challenge. Bumping up to a 9 for now. I will most likely be back to finish this one off.', '2006-10-27 08:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967416, 415041, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Great focus and clarity on the meerkat and your blurred background offers great colors and patterns that compliment him well without being overpowering. Has a "wild" feel to it. Excellent work. 8</td>', 'Very nice capture. Great focus and clarity on the meerkat and your blurred background offers great colors and patterns that compliment him well without being overpowering. Has a "wild" feel to it. Excellent work. 8', '2006-10-27 08:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967418, 416793, 53147, '<td valign="top">This is great. THere was another image inthis challenge very simialr but with a red background that I thought worked very well. This is a standout no less. Great detail on your front leaf and your blurred background is an excellent contrast that compliments it well. The green and soft random patterns balance out the strong red and patterned lines. This is a very pleasing shot. 8 for now.</td>', 'This is great. THere was another image inthis challenge very simialr but with a red background that I thought worked very well. This is a standout no less. Great detail on your front leaf and your blurred background is an excellent contrast that compliments it well. The green and soft random patterns balance out the strong red and patterned lines. This is a very pleasing shot. 8 for now.', '2006-10-27 08:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967421, 415419, 53147, '<td valign="top">This is nice. One of the better single flower images. You have a nice placement of the in focus front flower and your blurred background offers pleasant colors that compliments it well. While maybe not what most are looking for in bokeh I think you met the challenge well with a pleasing image that was enhanced by the background. Very pretty and pleasing shot.</td>', 'This is nice. One of the better single flower images. You have a nice placement of the in focus front flower and your blurred background offers pleasant colors that compliments it well. While maybe not what most are looking for in bokeh I think you met the challenge well with a pleasing image that was enhanced by the background. Very pretty and pleasing shot.', '2006-10-27 08:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967423, 415956, 53147, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. You took an object and actually made it work with the background bokeh. So many images the two parts did not fit or make sense. This was a brilliant choice. The colors compliment each other well from front to back as well as the patterns. Great DOF on the ornament and it is very nice that the bokeh starts on it rather than the whole bulb being in focus. A very nice touch. I think you could probably market this image to upscale department stores during the holidays. Bumping up to an 8.</td>', 'Interesting shot. You took an object and actually made it work with the background bokeh. So many images the two parts did not fit or make sense. This was a brilliant choice. The colors compliment each other well from front to back as well as the patterns. Great DOF on the ornament and it is very nice that the bokeh starts on it rather than the whole bulb being in focus. A very nice touch. I think you could probably market this image to upscale department stores during the holidays. Bumping up to an 8.', '2006-10-27 08:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967427, 413911, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea. I had not seen this before this challenge. The strongest of the similar ones in the challenge. Great placement of the camera. The blurred background is what makes this shot. It has a slightly gimmick feel to it but it is clean and the colors are pleasing. Good capture.</td>', 'Very creative idea. I had not seen this before this challenge. The strongest of the similar ones in the challenge. Great placement of the camera. The blurred background is what makes this shot. It has a slightly gimmick feel to it but it is clean and the colors are pleasing. Good capture.', '2006-10-27 08:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967428, 413761, 27524, '<td valign="top">This is amazing shot...defenetly very original. Very soft and nice background. 10</td>', 'This is amazing shot...defenetly very original. Very soft and nice background. 10', '2006-10-27 08:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967429, 416296, 53147, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. Great clarity on the cicada shell and the blurred background is a perfect compliment without being overpowering. It adds great colors and patterns and finishes off the image nicely. Very pleasant shot to what many would consider to be a very ugly creature.</td>', 'I like this shot. Great clarity on the cicada shell and the blurred background is a perfect compliment without being overpowering. It adds great colors and patterns and finishes off the image nicely. Very pleasant shot to what many would consider to be a very ugly creature.', '2006-10-27 08:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967431, 416993, 53147, '<td valign="top">I am not usually one for wine glass shots but this has a different feel to it. You have made the bokeh the primary aspect of the image without it being silly. The refraction works well and I really like the dark moody tones that you have caught. Maybe a bit wide onthe border but that wont affect my vote. Nice capture.</td>', 'I am not usually one for wine glass shots but this has a different feel to it. You have made the bokeh the primary aspect of the image without it being silly. The refraction works well and I really like the dark moody tones that you have caught. Maybe a bit wide onthe border but that wont affect my vote. Nice capture.', '2006-10-27 08:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967433, 416210, 27524, '<td valign="top">Yet another of those amazing macros...</td>', 'Yet another of those amazing macros...', '2006-10-27 08:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967435, 416996, 64928, '<td valign="top">Very nice bokeh and happy faces, but the child''s face seems a bit over exposed.I like the composition. 8</td>', 'Very nice bokeh and happy faces, but the child''s face seems a bit over exposed.I like the composition. 8', '2006-10-27 08:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967438, 415698, 53147, '<td valign="top">I guess I am just not catching the bokeh on this one. Everything seems to be in focus pretty well throughout. It is a nice picture. Great lines and the funky tilt works well. I could see this doing gangbusters in another challenge.</td>', 'I guess I am just not catching the bokeh on this one. Everything seems to be in focus pretty well throughout. It is a nice picture. Great lines and the funky tilt works well. I could see this doing gangbusters in another challenge.', '2006-10-27 08:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967439, 416752, 64928, '<td valign="top">Rather than bokeh that adds to the picture, this just looks like a blurry picture to me.  Sorry</td>', 'Rather than bokeh that adds to the picture, this just looks like a blurry picture to me.  Sorry', '2006-10-27 08:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
