(2967609, 416986, 51538, '<td valign="top">Fore- and background visual interest are very nice.  The berries, not so easy to photograph, have a nice focus and exposure.  I look forward to knoeing more about the specs of the shot. 9.</td>', 'Fore- and background visual interest are very nice.  The berries, not so easy to photograph, have a nice focus and exposure.  I look forward to knoeing more about the specs of the shot. 9.', '2006-10-27 10:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967610, 415323, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this, but it seems as if their faces have too much post processing (like neat image or something) and their features are lost. I love high contrast and high key, but for some reason, there isn''t quite enough of that to work successfully for me. Love the guy''s eyes and the composition is good.</td>', 'I like the idea of this, but it seems as if their faces have too much post processing (like neat image or something) and their features are lost. I love high contrast and high key, but for some reason, there isn''t quite enough of that to work successfully for me. Love the guy''s eyes and the composition is good.', '2006-10-27 10:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
