(2967615, 416707, 5792, '<td valign="top">The pose, muted color, sharpness and lighting are all excellent. Unfortunately the bokeh, where the flame appears to come out of the bear''s head acts more as a distraction than providing highlighting support for your main subject. A slightly different placement of the background flame would make a great improvement.</td>', 'The pose, muted color, sharpness and lighting are all excellent. Unfortunately the bokeh, where the flame appears to come out of the bear''s head acts more as a distraction than providing highlighting support for your main subject. A slightly different placement of the background flame would make a great improvement.', '2006-10-27 10:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
