(2967649, 416668, 5792, '<td valign="top">Since they are overdone here I''m generally not a big fan of desaturated images but you''ve done an exceptional job with this one. The quality of the B&amp;W is superb and the tonality on your colors is very good. It has a bit to much foreground out-of-focus in the lower left and that acts as a distraction from the rest of the image.</td>', 'Since they are overdone here I''m generally not a big fan of desaturated images but you''ve done an exceptional job with this one. The quality of the B&W is superb and the tonality on your colors is very good. It has a bit to much foreground out-of-focus in the lower left and that acts as a distraction from the rest of the image.', '2006-10-27 10:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2967653, 416136, 67152, '<td valign="top">The flower itself is really well photographed - the sharpness of the image is great - but the background is a little subdued and uninteresting for my taste.</td>', 'The flower itself is really well photographed - the sharpness of the image is great - but the background is a little subdued and uninteresting for my taste.', '2006-10-27 10:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
