(2967702, 413795, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good sharpness with the tomatoes and the attempt at desaturation for further highlighting is a good idea. It nicely separates it from your background bokeh.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately the remaining reds in the other areas of the image are highly distracting and the bokeh support for your main subject is weak. Composition could be improved by off setting the main subject more and cropping it closer.</td>', 'Good sharpness with the tomatoes and the attempt at desaturation for further highlighting is a good idea. It nicely separates it from your background bokeh. Unfortunately the remaining reds in the other areas of the image are highly distracting and the bokeh support for your main subject is weak. Composition could be improved by off setting the main subject more and cropping it closer.', '2006-10-27 10:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
