(2968424, 416834, 5112, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a big bug!  And it looks ready to eat the beautiful flower - you got a problem I think :)  (if that''s your garden, maybe it''s someone else''s problem).  The bokeh is excellent, as is the clarity/focus on the subject.  The border looks a bit heavy to my eyes.  ~8</td>', 'Now that''s a big bug!  And it looks ready to eat the beautiful flower - you got a problem I think :)  (if that''s your garden, maybe it''s someone else''s problem).  The bokeh is excellent, as is the clarity/focus on the subject.  The border looks a bit heavy to my eyes.  ~8', '2006-10-27 15:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
