(2968428, 416445, 5112, '<td valign="top">That is one of the most interesting bokehs I''ve seen in the challenge.  That out of focus stained glass window really is something else.  The Christ looks like he''s looking at it.  Good job.  ~9</td>', 'That is one of the most interesting bokehs I''ve seen in the challenge.  That out of focus stained glass window really is something else.  The Christ looks like he''s looking at it.  Good job.  ~9', '2006-10-27 15:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
