(2970511, 416046, 63104, '<td valign="top">The background looks very heavily recovered, too much Shadow &amp; Highlight manipulation I''d guess, which has given it a rather surreal look, but it looks strained because of the over aggressive levels adjustment. Good composition, and nice model</td>', 'The background looks very heavily recovered, too much Shadow & Highlight manipulation I''d guess, which has given it a rather surreal look, but it looks strained because of the over aggressive levels adjustment. Good composition, and nice model', '2006-10-28 10:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
