(2970557, 415559, 24073, '<td valign="top">Portraiture seemed to be the going strategy for top spots this Bokeh round.  With this one its not the portrait so much, which is amazing, but its the bokeh that is lacking that certain pizazz. I still have this ranked really high in the crowd, Top 10, I only wanted to mention the bokeh in a lame attempt to be helpful.  LOL.  GL.</td>', 'Portraiture seemed to be the going strategy for top spots this Bokeh round.  With this one its not the portrait so much, which is amazing, but its the bokeh that is lacking that certain pizazz. I still have this ranked really high in the crowd, Top 10, I only wanted to mention the bokeh in a lame attempt to be helpful.  LOL.  GL.', '2006-10-28 10:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
