(2970561, 414042, 24073, '<td valign="top">Amazing Bokeh, very cool effect.  I''m trying to decide how well this will do beings everybody seems to be tired of flowers and butterflies.  I can say this, its going to be hard to go against it.  You really nailed it.  I''m bumping it up to my top 10.  GL.</td>', 'Amazing Bokeh, very cool effect.  I''m trying to decide how well this will do beings everybody seems to be tired of flowers and butterflies.  I can say this, its going to be hard to go against it.  You really nailed it.  I''m bumping it up to my top 10.  GL.', '2006-10-28 11:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
