(2970565, 415234, 24073, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to decide where I would hang this one in my house.  Definately a wall hanger.  I think its the tones, mood, depth, and of course bokeh, that are just simply amazing.  Very cool, well done.  Way to go with balancing it so perfect.  GL.</td>', 'I''m trying to decide where I would hang this one in my house.  Definately a wall hanger.  I think its the tones, mood, depth, and of course bokeh, that are just simply amazing.  Very cool, well done.  Way to go with balancing it so perfect.  GL.', '2006-10-28 11:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970567, 416201, 24073, '<td valign="top">alright now, bragger.  You got skills, and vision.  This is awesome.  So heavenly, and light weighted.  It cheers me up just looking at it.  Way to go, I''m bumping up.  GL.</td>', 'alright now, bragger.  You got skills, and vision.  This is awesome.  So heavenly, and light weighted.  It cheers me up just looking at it.  Way to go, I''m bumping up.  GL.', '2006-10-28 11:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970579, 416401, 24073, '<td valign="top">This is nice, really cool vision.  The two look so much alike that for some reason my mind doesn''t see family.  My mind goes out of its way to see this as being 1 mom replicated to both sides of her baby.  Like sheltering the young.  GL, I hope you understand the comment, and its helpful.  It may be the sort of bias that says a Dad must be taller, and bigger, and these two are just so equal.</td>', 'This is nice, really cool vision.  The two look so much alike that for some reason my mind doesn''t see family.  My mind goes out of its way to see this as being 1 mom replicated to both sides of her baby.  Like sheltering the young.  GL, I hope you understand the comment, and its helpful.  It may be the sort of bias that says a Dad must be taller, and bigger, and these two are just so equal.', '2006-10-28 11:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2970581, 413561, 24073, '<td valign="top">An amazing capture.  And the bokeh is spectactular.  The crispness of the gull suggests a very high Shutterspeed, but the overexposure suggests a slower one.  I''m gonna watch this one, I''m interested in seeing your settings and lens.</td>', 'An amazing capture.  And the bokeh is spectactular.  The crispness of the gull suggests a very high Shutterspeed, but the overexposure suggests a slower one.  I''m gonna watch this one, I''m interested in seeing your settings and lens.', '2006-10-28 11:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
