(2971056, 414928, 31443, '<td valign="top">I have these moths coming into my garden just before sunset but never managed to capture any shots of them, this is really special, just love the bokeh and the colors...</td>', 'I have these moths coming into my garden just before sunset but never managed to capture any shots of them, this is really special, just love the bokeh and the colors...', '2006-10-28 16:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
