(2971247, 416412, 31443, '<td valign="top">Simple and a pleasure to look at, the bokeh with reflection is great!</td>', 'Simple and a pleasure to look at, the bokeh with reflection is great!', '2006-10-28 18:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
