(2971322, 416893, 5112, '<td valign="top">Muy bonito!  Very good.  ~9</td>', 'Muy bonito!  Very good.  ~9', '2006-10-28 19:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971329, 413929, 5112, '<td valign="top">So this one pops up, hmmmm, looks sort of familiar.  I have a very similar image in my portfolio. :)  Yours is lovely.  The colour is fantastic, the purple pink just glows, almost like the colour of those glow sticks.  Cool!  If anything, the light looks a bit harsh.  I like the composition very much.  Did you notice that the drops on the front petal look almost like a face?<br/> <br/>My daughter just came by and said, "Ooooh, that''s pretty!  Looks like one of your pictures, like the blue one."  At least she knows my pictures ;-)<br/> <br/>~9 from me.</td>', 'So this one pops up, hmmmm, looks sort of familiar.  I have a very similar image in my portfolio. :)  Yours is lovely.  The colour is fantastic, the purple pink just glows, almost like the colour of those glow sticks.  Cool!  If anything, the light looks a bit harsh.  I like the composition very much.  Did you notice that the drops on the front petal look almost like a face? My daughter just came by and said, "Ooooh, that''s pretty!  Looks like one of your pictures, like the blue one."  At least she knows my pictures ;-) ~9 from me.', '2006-10-28 19:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971331, 415078, 5112, '<td valign="top">Not all that much of a bokeh, but the colour of the sky is beautiful.</td>', 'Not all that much of a bokeh, but the colour of the sky is beautiful.', '2006-10-28 19:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971333, 414812, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Everybody has to have one of these :)  It looks good in b/w.  I like how it fades into the background.  ~8</td>', 'Nice.  Everybody has to have one of these :)  It looks good in b/w.  I like how it fades into the background.  ~8', '2006-10-28 19:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971334, 416917, 5112, '<td valign="top">Funny title!</td>', 'Funny title!', '2006-10-28 19:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971338, 416113, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Makes me laugh (in the good sense, not like laughing about your picture).   Beautiful clarity in front, the going out of focus tail looks humongous, and the greenish background really enhances the photo.  ~8</td>', 'Nice!  Makes me laugh (in the good sense, not like laughing about your picture).   Beautiful clarity in front, the going out of focus tail looks humongous, and the greenish background really enhances the photo.  ~8', '2006-10-28 19:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971340, 416885, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful idea, the orange on blueish background is good, the bokeh is great.  The main flower is a bit soft, and I wish the other part flower were not in the picture.  I don''t particularily like the border, it makes a delicate image look a bit in your face.</td>', 'Beautiful idea, the orange on blueish background is good, the bokeh is great.  The main flower is a bit soft, and I wish the other part flower were not in the picture.  I don''t particularily like the border, it makes a delicate image look a bit in your face.', '2006-10-28 19:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971341, 416247, 5112, '<td valign="top">Almost abstract, very pretty.</td>', 'Almost abstract, very pretty.', '2006-10-28 19:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971342, 414282, 5112, '<td valign="top">That mantis is posing just right for you!  Awesome.  Looks also like it''s thinking about eating you after you make the picture.  I hope it didn''t.  ~9</td>', 'That mantis is posing just right for you!  Awesome.  Looks also like it''s thinking about eating you after you make the picture.  I hope it didn''t.  ~9', '2006-10-28 19:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971343, 415102, 5112, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, to me this looks more like panning than bokeh, although I guess you could have both, but in this case the blur seems to be from motion, not shallow DOF.  The truck looks very bright.  ~5</td>', 'I don''t know, to me this looks more like panning than bokeh, although I guess you could have both, but in this case the blur seems to be from motion, not shallow DOF.  The truck looks very bright.  ~5', '2006-10-28 19:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2971344, 415264, 5112, '<td valign="top">This is actually a really cool looking picture.  One instance where big fat borders on two sides really works.  The selective focus is excellent here, and you have a front bokeh that''s awesome.  ~10</td>', 'This is actually a really cool looking picture.  One instance where big fat borders on two sides really works.  The selective focus is excellent here, and you have a front bokeh that''s awesome.  ~10', '2006-10-28 19:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
