(2973286, 416529, 60047, '<td valign="top">Your out-of-focus part of the photo is still too "in focus" to evolve into good bokeh. Also, the subject you have in focus might be something a little more captivating (like a hair braid end, hair bow, or her collar). A noble effort!</td>', 'Your out-of-focus part of the photo is still too "in focus" to evolve into good bokeh. Also, the subject you have in focus might be something a little more captivating (like a hair braid end, hair bow, or her collar). A noble effort!', '2006-10-29 17:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
