(2973924, 416512, 3735, '<td valign="top">Loosely defined, bokeh is the quality and "feel" of the out-of-focus foreground or background elements of a photo. It isn''t very interesting by itself, but take a photograph whose subject is enhanced by the bokeh of the background. <br/>(This one is the way it is supposed to be!!)   10</td>', 'Loosely defined, bokeh is the quality and "feel" of the out-of-focus foreground or background elements of a photo. It isn''t very interesting by itself, but take a photograph whose subject is enhanced by the bokeh of the background. (This one is the way it is supposed to be!!)   10', '2006-10-29 22:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
