(2974700, 414931, 5792, '<td valign="top">Pleasing smooth bokeh on a nice floral subject. Image appears very flat so you might want to consider upping the contrast. Warm tones are OK, but it weakens the green color of the leaves considerably, so you might have overdone it. In images like this you might want to try out ''autocontrast'', ''autocolor'' and/or ''autolevels'' adjustments first with your image editor if it has the ability to do that. You would not necessarily accept those adjustments but they will give you an idea where the weaknesses of an image might be. Typically, after post processing you will normally see little or no change applying those functions.</td>', 'Pleasing smooth bokeh on a nice floral subject. Image appears very flat so you might want to consider upping the contrast. Warm tones are OK, but it weakens the green color of the leaves considerably, so you might have overdone it. In images like this you might want to try out ''autocontrast'', ''autocolor'' and/or ''autolevels'' adjustments first with your image editor if it has the ability to do that. You would not necessarily accept those adjustments but they will give you an idea where the weaknesses of an image might be. Typically, after post processing you will normally see little or no change applying those functions.', '2006-10-30 04:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
