(2977938, 415518, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice set up of the image - you have met the challenge well.  I like the conversion to B/W for this subject.</td>', 'Nice set up of the image - you have met the challenge well.  I like the conversion to B/W for this subject.', '2006-10-31 06:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977942, 416830, 66923, '<td valign="top">love the light here! great shot!! well done!</td>', 'love the light here! great shot!! well done!', '2006-10-31 06:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977945, 417029, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice use of rule of thirds and a ''mirroring'' style on the two columns.  You met the challenge very well.</td>', 'Nice use of rule of thirds and a ''mirroring'' style on the two columns.  You met the challenge very well.', '2006-10-31 06:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977947, 414864, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot -the bokeh continues the theme of the in focus image</td>', 'Very nice shot -the bokeh continues the theme of the in focus image', '2006-10-31 06:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977948, 413943, 66923, '<td valign="top">a shot for communist nostalgia? nice colours, but too centered, maybe.. cool shot!!</td>', 'a shot for communist nostalgia? nice colours, but too centered, maybe.. cool shot!!', '2006-10-31 06:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977949, 414708, 67152, '<td valign="top">The bacground colors are amazing.  Nice photo.</td>', 'The bacground colors are amazing.  Nice photo.', '2006-10-31 06:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977950, 415234, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph - the cropping, contrast and colors are all well done.  Great job meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent photograph - the cropping, contrast and colors are all well done.  Great job meeting the challenge.', '2006-10-31 06:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977952, 416119, 66923, '<td valign="top">hmmm... i love these tones!! i just wish the background could be reversed so that the top part of the vine would be in front of the lighter zone... I love this shot nevertheless!</td>', 'hmmm... i love these tones!! i just wish the background could be reversed so that the top part of the vine would be in front of the lighter zone... I love this shot nevertheless!', '2006-10-31 06:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977953, 415997, 67152, '<td valign="top">I love the leaf a whole bunch - the contrast of the frost on the green is quite good, but the bokeh does not add a lot to the picture for for me.</td>', 'I love the leaf a whole bunch - the contrast of the frost on the green is quite good, but the bokeh does not add a lot to the picture for for me.', '2006-10-31 06:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977956, 414042, 67152, '<td valign="top">The bokeh in this photo is great - i like the lines - almost like paint strokes.  The color in the background really complements the butterfly</td>', 'The bokeh in this photo is great - i like the lines - almost like paint strokes.  The color in the background really complements the butterfly', '2006-10-31 06:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977957, 416797, 66923, '<td valign="top">interesting abstract shot! cool shot!</td>', 'interesting abstract shot! cool shot!', '2006-10-31 06:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977968, 416989, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice simple idea and excellent execution.</td>', 'Nice simple idea and excellent execution.', '2006-10-31 06:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977991, 416025, 65125, '<td valign="top">Good title. :) The lightning could be better though.</td>', 'Good title. :) The lightning could be better though.', '2006-10-31 06:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977993, 416910, 65125, '<td valign="top">The leaves should be in focus, not the grass. Nice colours otherwise.</td>', 'The leaves should be in focus, not the grass. Nice colours otherwise.', '2006-10-31 06:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977996, 416925, 65125, '<td valign="top">Too dark, no faces seen.</td>', 'Too dark, no faces seen.', '2006-10-31 06:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2977997, 414814, 65125, '<td valign="top">Great photo, good control over DOF.</td>', 'Great photo, good control over DOF.', '2006-10-31 06:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978148, 414348, 59819, '<td valign="top">The photo is beautiful - I just think it''s a bit too sharpened, and I find the halo around the leaves(?) very obvious.</td>', 'The photo is beautiful - I just think it''s a bit too sharpened, and I find the halo around the leaves(?) very obvious.', '2006-10-31 08:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978154, 416285, 48563, '<td valign="top">Love the Background ligths.. Well done job. thanxs for sharing.</td>', 'Love the Background ligths.. Well done job. thanxs for sharing.', '2006-10-31 08:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978155, 416989, 59819, '<td valign="top">Lol - neat idea!  Great job.</td>', 'Lol - neat idea!  Great job.', '2006-10-31 08:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978160, 415781, 59819, '<td valign="top">Wow - that''s pretty cool.  Great job on the focus - sucks me right into the picture. Thanks :)</td>', 'Wow - that''s pretty cool.  Great job on the focus - sucks me right into the picture. Thanks :)', '2006-10-31 08:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978164, 417003, 59819, '<td valign="top">If the subject were flowers, it''s be really nice - but the Bokeh in this is really boring to me.</td>', 'If the subject were flowers, it''s be really nice - but the Bokeh in this is really boring to me.', '2006-10-31 08:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978281, 416972, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge theme. Nicely executed and well composed. Would have been nice to see both eyes but that was probably difficult enough to capture as is. :)</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge theme. Nicely executed and well composed. Would have been nice to see both eyes but that was probably difficult enough to capture as is. :)', '2006-10-31 09:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978315, 416404, 5792, '<td valign="top">Tecnically superior image. Very well composed, incredible sharpness to the leaves and great bokeh. I''ll be interested to see how this image compares to my own submission. Yours is the better photograph. Basically we did the same thing, went for the ''little circles'' with an OK but nothing spectacular foreground main subject. I suspect you were trying to do the same thing as me, make the bokeh as strong or stronger as the main subject itseld.</td>', 'Tecnically superior image. Very well composed, incredible sharpness to the leaves and great bokeh. I''ll be interested to see how this image compares to my own submission. Yours is the better photograph. Basically we did the same thing, went for the ''little circles'' with an OK but nothing spectacular foreground main subject. I suspect you were trying to do the same thing as me, make the bokeh as strong or stronger as the main subject itseld.', '2006-10-31 09:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978332, 416169, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tree frog shot. It has perfect sharpness, color, detail and enough depth of field. The hand or whatever the object is that the frog is sitting on looks as though it might have had noise reduction applied and became slightly oversmooth and looks almost artificial. That is a bit of a distraction. Overall, nice job!</td>', 'Beautiful tree frog shot. It has perfect sharpness, color, detail and enough depth of field. The hand or whatever the object is that the frog is sitting on looks as though it might have had noise reduction applied and became slightly oversmooth and looks almost artificial. That is a bit of a distraction. Overall, nice job!', '2006-10-31 09:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978350, 415358, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice use of foreground bokeh - not many attempted this challenging approach!</td>', 'Nice use of foreground bokeh - not many attempted this challenging approach!', '2006-10-31 09:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978365, 416201, 66353, '<td valign="top">Beautiful :)<br/>Came back to bump you up - hope to see a ribbon here (probably unlikely as it seems that the only thing that counts for most people in this challenge are "circles of confusion" - but I still believe this is the best shot in the challenge. Composition and colours are perfect and so is bokeh IMO.</td>', 'Beautiful :)Came back to bump you up - hope to see a ribbon here (probably unlikely as it seems that the only thing that counts for most people in this challenge are "circles of confusion" - but I still believe this is the best shot in the challenge. Composition and colours are perfect and so is bokeh IMO.', '2006-10-31 10:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978378, 416893, 66353, '<td valign="top">Bumping you up a bit - it''s an excellent shot. Great colours and composition...</td>', 'Bumping you up a bit - it''s an excellent shot. Great colours and composition...', '2006-10-31 10:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978379, 417012, 66353, '<td valign="top">Came back to bump you up a bit - love the colours here...</td>', 'Came back to bump you up a bit - love the colours here...', '2006-10-31 10:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978524, 416771, 29440, '<td valign="top">You have caputured the true images of bokeh.  There was a tutorial on DPC about one year ago that gave a definition of bokeh and how to achieve the little light circles.  I believe that is what bokeh is all about.  An out of focus background is not true bokeh.  If that is what the challenge criteria is then they should rename the challenge to out of focus background.  10</td>', 'You have caputured the true images of bokeh.  There was a tutorial on DPC about one year ago that gave a definition of bokeh and how to achieve the little light circles.  I believe that is what bokeh is all about.  An out of focus background is not true bokeh.  If that is what the challenge criteria is then they should rename the challenge to out of focus background.  10', '2006-10-31 11:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978576, 416046, 60981, '<td valign="top">Is that halo due to HDR?</td>', 'Is that halo due to HDR?', '2006-10-31 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978578, 416349, 50695, '<td valign="top">Perfect fulfillment of the challenge. Bokeh is not the subject, but it is prominent and enhances the subject... and is visually stunning. I don''t even like raptor shots, but this demands attention. Mostly because of the bokeh, but also the unusual coloring and the patterns of light on the bird''s wing. Simply gorgeous. 10</td>', 'Perfect fulfillment of the challenge. Bokeh is not the subject, but it is prominent and enhances the subject... and is visually stunning. I don''t even like raptor shots, but this demands attention. Mostly because of the bokeh, but also the unusual coloring and the patterns of light on the bird''s wing. Simply gorgeous. 10', '2006-10-31 11:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978579, 416972, 50695, '<td valign="top">wonderful forground bokeh (whatever that is). just enough is revealed and just enough is hidden. 10</td>', 'wonderful forground bokeh (whatever that is). just enough is revealed and just enough is hidden. 10', '2006-10-31 11:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978581, 416510, 50543, '<td valign="top">nice concept..sets this apart from the typical flower bokeh image :)</td>', 'nice concept..sets this apart from the typical flower bokeh image :)', '2006-10-31 11:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978582, 416119, 50695, '<td valign="top">Moody shot, offbeat but totally effective composition. And oh yeah, great Bokeh! 10</td>', 'Moody shot, offbeat but totally effective composition. And oh yeah, great Bokeh! 10', '2006-10-31 11:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978583, 417030, 50543, '<td valign="top">fun colours!</td>', 'fun colours!', '2006-10-31 11:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978588, 416771, 50695, '<td valign="top">I have other 10s in this composition, but I would give this an 11 if I could. This is my blue ribbon (which means your score is doomed. Sorry.). Your bokeh as ghosts in it that repeat the shapes of the foreground subject. How the heck did you even do that?? Your subject has beautiful motion blur that would be fascinating even without the magnificent bokeh behind it. Wow, wow and again wow. Have a fave and a smile. :)</td>', 'I have other 10s in this composition, but I would give this an 11 if I could. This is my blue ribbon (which means your score is doomed. Sorry.). Your bokeh as ghosts in it that repeat the shapes of the foreground subject. How the heck did you even do that?? Your subject has beautiful motion blur that would be fascinating even without the magnificent bokeh behind it. Wow, wow and again wow. Have a fave and a smile. :)', '2006-10-31 11:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978589, 417033, 50695, '<td valign="top">Incredible sense of drama and epic scope achieved for a handful of xmas lights?? Miraculous. And bokeh is an essential part of the effect. 10</td>', 'Incredible sense of drama and epic scope achieved for a handful of xmas lights?? Miraculous. And bokeh is an essential part of the effect. 10', '2006-10-31 11:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978594, 416416, 28532, '<td valign="top">What a stunning shot!!  nice job!!</td>', 'What a stunning shot!!  nice job!!', '2006-10-31 11:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978595, 415419, 28532, '<td valign="top">I love the colors - it''s a very pretty shot!!</td>', 'I love the colors - it''s a very pretty shot!!', '2006-10-31 11:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978598, 414712, 50695, '<td valign="top">The background adds compositional interest but also suggests themes for the portrait, since a fence has so much symbolism in it. Combined with your title, I imagine the child will always be figuring out ways around fences. He also seems a little saddened by it, even though he''s not looking at it. But the fence is contrasted by the sky that is reflected in his eyes. I think I also see the reflection of an adult figure. Is he a fence, an obstacle to the sky? Or is he the gatekeeper that will open up new worlds? 9</td>', 'The background adds compositional interest but also suggests themes for the portrait, since a fence has so much symbolism in it. Combined with your title, I imagine the child will always be figuring out ways around fences. He also seems a little saddened by it, even though he''s not looking at it. But the fence is contrasted by the sky that is reflected in his eyes. I think I also see the reflection of an adult figure. Is he a fence, an obstacle to the sky? Or is he the gatekeeper that will open up new worlds? 9', '2006-10-31 11:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978599, 416446, 50695, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing here that I recognize as bokeh, but this is such a brilliant photo that I have to give it a 9. Just look at how expressive those lines of rain are, and how monumental that dark shape is. Wow.</td>', 'There''s nothing here that I recognize as bokeh, but this is such a brilliant photo that I have to give it a 9. Just look at how expressive those lines of rain are, and how monumental that dark shape is. Wow.', '2006-10-31 11:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978603, 415140, 50695, '<td valign="top">I bumped this up to 8 from 7 because of your daring composition and the wonderful spidery shape of that flower. A real pleasure to look at.</td>', 'I bumped this up to 8 from 7 because of your daring composition and the wonderful spidery shape of that flower. A real pleasure to look at.', '2006-10-31 11:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978607, 414812, 50695, '<td valign="top">Amazing. You''ve found a fresh approach to the dandelion. My only qualm is that you''ve put the subject in the expected position right on the thirds. Once you leave the box, don''t look back! 8</td>', 'Amazing. You''ve found a fresh approach to the dandelion. My only qualm is that you''ve put the subject in the expected position right on the thirds. Once you leave the box, don''t look back! 8', '2006-10-31 11:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978610, 416027, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think your processing enhances the best qualities of this photograph, its chaotic but coherent feeling. I love how the daisies defy my expectation for them to be white. This has all the pleasures of abstract expressionism. 9</td>', 'I think your processing enhances the best qualities of this photograph, its chaotic but coherent feeling. I love how the daisies defy my expectation for them to be white. This has all the pleasures of abstract expressionism. 9', '2006-10-31 11:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978617, 413797, 50695, '<td valign="top">great textures and tones, eye-catching composition. It doesn''t move me, but it does demand respect. 8</td>', 'great textures and tones, eye-catching composition. It doesn''t move me, but it does demand respect. 8', '2006-10-31 11:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978621, 416736, 50695, '<td valign="top">what really wins me over is the bokeh. It looks like veins, making skin of sky! 8</td>', 'what really wins me over is the bokeh. It looks like veins, making skin of sky! 8', '2006-10-31 11:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978623, 416925, 50695, '<td valign="top">a great subject, so mysterious. 9</td>', 'a great subject, so mysterious. 9', '2006-10-31 11:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978638, 416828, 16241, '<td valign="top">excellent bokeh</td>', 'excellent bokeh', '2006-10-31 12:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978640, 414656, 16241, '<td valign="top">very pretty!</td>', 'very pretty!', '2006-10-31 12:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978642, 416736, 16241, '<td valign="top">loverly!</td>', 'loverly!', '2006-10-31 12:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978643, 416968, 16241, '<td valign="top">adorable!</td>', 'adorable!', '2006-10-31 12:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978644, 415816, 16241, '<td valign="top">oh yes!</td>', 'oh yes!', '2006-10-31 12:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978645, 415781, 16241, '<td valign="top">tiger woods?  nice idea.</td>', 'tiger woods?  nice idea.', '2006-10-31 12:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978649, 416509, 16241, '<td valign="top">stunning.</td>', 'stunning.', '2006-10-31 12:10:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2978650, 415664, 16241, '<td valign="top">great one.</td>', 'great one.', '2006-10-31 12:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978653, 414679, 16241, '<td valign="top">superb</td>', 'superb', '2006-10-31 12:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978658, 415078, 58330, '<td valign="top">If you stare at the leaf long enough it is almost a bat flying past. The concept is good, but you need some more leaves in the background to reduce the blue, which is a bit too unvaried in colour. You had the start of lovely contrast at the top curl of the leaf and where the stalk (twig) goes to the top right corner. Imagine a bit more of that and the effect it would have had on the leaf! And of course everyone else would have told you that your pic should have been bigger than 374x281 for better effect. I look forward to your next one.6</td>', 'If you stare at the leaf long enough it is almost a bat flying past. The concept is good, but you need some more leaves in the background to reduce the blue, which is a bit too unvaried in colour. You had the start of lovely contrast at the top curl of the leaf and where the stalk (twig) goes to the top right corner. Imagine a bit more of that and the effect it would have had on the leaf! And of course everyone else would have told you that your pic should have been bigger than 374x281 for better effect. I look forward to your next one.6', '2006-10-31 12:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978660, 416210, 16241, '<td valign="top">dax is gonna win a ribbon!   (compliment if it isnt dax) 10</td>', 'dax is gonna win a ribbon!   (compliment if it isnt dax) 10', '2006-10-31 12:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978661, 416771, 16241, '<td valign="top">amazing</td>', 'amazing', '2006-10-31 12:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978732, 416496, 67064, '<td valign="top">Leaf could have been more colorful to contrast with background more</td>', 'Leaf could have been more colorful to contrast with background more', '2006-10-31 12:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978735, 415948, 67064, '<td valign="top">Nice image, sharpness and blurry where need be and good colors in image.</td>', 'Nice image, sharpness and blurry where need be and good colors in image.', '2006-10-31 12:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978736, 413839, 67064, '<td valign="top">Nicely done</td>', 'Nicely done', '2006-10-31 12:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978740, 414648, 67064, '<td valign="top">not enuf contrast</td>', 'not enuf contrast', '2006-10-31 12:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978742, 415680, 67064, '<td valign="top">nicely captured</td>', 'nicely captured', '2006-10-31 12:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978743, 415391, 67064, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors and feel of image</td>', 'beautiful colors and feel of image', '2006-10-31 12:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978746, 415181, 67064, '<td valign="top">not real sure what image is of.</td>', 'not real sure what image is of.', '2006-10-31 12:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978747, 415462, 67064, '<td valign="top">fowl could have been lighter.  pretty water colors</td>', 'fowl could have been lighter.  pretty water colors', '2006-10-31 12:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978748, 415076, 67064, '<td valign="top">nice detail, colors and blur</td>', 'nice detail, colors and blur', '2006-10-31 12:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978755, 415932, 3102, '<td valign="top">One of my two 10s this time around.  Great clarity and a super representation of the challenge.</td>', 'One of my two 10s this time around.  Great clarity and a super representation of the challenge.', '2006-10-31 13:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978760, 416284, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done -- one of my favorites this time around.  The light on the book seems just slightly too hot for me... that''s the only thing keeping me from voting it a 10.</td>', 'Very nicely done -- one of my favorites this time around.  The light on the book seems just slightly too hot for me... that''s the only thing keeping me from voting it a 10.', '2006-10-31 13:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978764, 415076, 3102, '<td valign="top">Lots and lots of leaves this time around, but I think this is a standout amongst them.  The bokeh is silky smooth on this one -- nicely done!</td>', 'Lots and lots of leaves this time around, but I think this is a standout amongst them.  The bokeh is silky smooth on this one -- nicely done!', '2006-10-31 13:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978766, 416280, 32872, '<td valign="top">Cool image.</td>', 'Cool image.', '2006-10-31 13:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978775, 416845, 32872, '<td valign="top">Your BOKEH looks like a fine abstract painting to me.  The shapes and colors are so pretty.  I wish the leaf was a litle bit sharper, but I love the background!</td>', 'Your BOKEH looks like a fine abstract painting to me.  The shapes and colors are so pretty.  I wish the leaf was a litle bit sharper, but I love the background!', '2006-10-31 13:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978837, 416752, 42043, '<td valign="top">Not at all in focus so no area is contrasting with others like the challenge is wanting</td>', 'Not at all in focus so no area is contrasting with others like the challenge is wanting', '2006-10-31 13:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978840, 416170, 67578, '<td valign="top">i like it</td>', 'i like it', '2006-10-31 13:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978886, 416169, 35947, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop on the frog would be better then the center composition IMHO.</td>', 'A tighter crop on the frog would be better then the center composition IMHO.', '2006-10-31 14:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978902, 413585, 65125, '<td valign="top">I dont see any bokeh, except for the little hole at the right.</td>', 'I dont see any bokeh, except for the little hole at the right.', '2006-10-31 14:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978906, 414628, 65125, '<td valign="top">It would be better without the frame. Nice photo otherwise.</td>', 'It would be better without the frame. Nice photo otherwise.', '2006-10-31 14:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2978921, 416971, 65125, '<td valign="top">Too bad the head isn''t in focus.</td>', 'Too bad the head isn''t in focus.', '2006-10-31 14:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
