(2986605, 416780, 29490, '<td valign="top">4.7 vs 5.2, not bad for your first sub and your mom''s what?  2000th? :)<br/> <br/>I think a little more dof to get the whole face in focus would have helped, and maybe cropping the first 20 or so pixels on the left (the verticaloid light and dark thingamabob) out would help with eye flow.  Maybe more negative space on the right?<br/> <br/>Overall mucho bokeh, but maybe not evident enough for voters to appreciate.  <br/> <br/>Nicely done first challenge.<br/> <br/>ETA<br/>4.7747?!?  You got a full house!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-01 20:57:02.</i></td>', '4.7 vs 5.2, not bad for your first sub and your mom''s what?  2000th? :) I think a little more dof to get the whole face in focus would have helped, and maybe cropping the first 20 or so pixels on the left (the verticaloid light and dark thingamabob) out would help with eye flow.  Maybe more negative space on the right? Overall mucho bokeh, but maybe not evident enough for voters to appreciate.   Nicely done first challenge. ETA4.7747?!?  You got a full house!', '2006-11-01 20:56:10.000000', '2006-11-01 20:57:02.000000', 0),
