(2988089, 415782, 65592, '<td valign="top">Hi all, thank you for your comments,<br/> <br/>Van: I did not try different background colors, but i agree with you that maybe a blue background would help to achieve a better result. The background in that picture is a stone wall that is completely out of focus. I liked the color so i kept it.<br/> <br/>Mast: I avoid deliberately that the full stem was in focus to avoid a flat picture, maybe it was a mistake...¿?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-02 06:42:40.</i></td>', 'Hi all, thank you for your comments, Van: I did not try different background colors, but i agree with you that maybe a blue background would help to achieve a better result. The background in that picture is a stone wall that is completely out of focus. I liked the color so i kept it. Mast: I avoid deliberately that the full stem was in focus to avoid a flat picture, maybe it was a mistake...¿?', '2006-11-02 06:41:58.000000', '2006-11-02 06:42:40.000000', 0),
(2988127, 414928, 32767, '<td valign="top">Hey Doc-Nice job. Congrats on your ribbon. Good to see you back.</td>', 'Hey Doc-Nice job. Congrats on your ribbon. Good to see you back.', '2006-11-02 06:51:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2988237, 416972, 27482, '<td valign="top">Gotta agree with the comment about this one scoring a below 6, I would have given it a 9, only leaving out the 10 because I would have wanted to see a stronger focus on her eye, it seems a little bit out of focus (at least I assume that is the problem as motion blur seems out of the question at 1/350)  Really dig this shot and the coloring, composition and moment are ACE.  Went to my favorites.</td>', 'Gotta agree with the comment about this one scoring a below 6, I would have given it a 9, only leaving out the 10 because I would have wanted to see a stronger focus on her eye, it seems a little bit out of focus (at least I assume that is the problem as motion blur seems out of the question at 1/350)  Really dig this shot and the coloring, composition and moment are ACE.  Went to my favorites.', '2006-11-02 07:36:48.000000', NULL, 0),
