(2992357, 416800, 67258, '<td valign="top">Having read your description of how you achieved this shot, I rescind my comment about no bokeh; when commenting before, I had thought you had achieved the effect in PS. I think it a lovely photo, as I did before, but I am even more impressed with your technical skill now I know the techniques you used.</td>', 'Having read your description of how you achieved this shot, I rescind my comment about no bokeh; when commenting before, I had thought you had achieved the effect in PS. I think it a lovely photo, as I did before, but I am even more impressed with your technical skill now I know the techniques you used.', '2006-11-03 03:45:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2992503, 415043, 27812, '<td valign="top">Brad, do not allow this placing to get to you. Although you should know in general DPC do not like pics of dolls and toys and whatever, you should remind yourself that you take pics for yourself. The only way to improve is by noting what they ''say'' in their scores and comments... and then to go and improve on it.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on the new camera and lenses.... now you are going to kick ass!</td>', 'Brad, do not allow this placing to get to you. Although you should know in general DPC do not like pics of dolls and toys and whatever, you should remind yourself that you take pics for yourself. The only way to improve is by noting what they ''say'' in their scores and comments... and then to go and improve on it. Congratulations on the new camera and lenses.... now you are going to kick ass!', '2006-11-03 05:18:53.000000', NULL, 0),
