(2999795, 416682, 44099, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments! This is now my second highest rated photograph, but I''m still on my way to break 6.<br/> <br/>Anyway I had a few other macros with better, more attractive and more noticeable bokeh, but I liked the composition and contrast of this shot so much I was blinded of the actual contest. I''ll keep the contest theme in mind a bit more next time. Thanks again!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments! This is now my second highest rated photograph, but I''m still on my way to break 6. Anyway I had a few other macros with better, more attractive and more noticeable bokeh, but I liked the composition and contrast of this shot so much I was blinded of the actual contest. I''ll keep the contest theme in mind a bit more next time. Thanks again!', '2006-11-05 01:01:48.000000', NULL, 0),
