(3501478, 416506, 14986, '<td valign="top">Considering the challenge was bokeh, I''m not all that impressed with the bokeh that is here.  I see it, but I don''t think it really is the focus of the photograph or add much to it.   On it''s own, outside of the challenge, it''s a nice shot...perhaps a bit tight in the crop at the top.  Some nice textures and good exposure in the different lighting areas of the photo.</td>', 'Considering the challenge was bokeh, I''m not all that impressed with the bokeh that is here.  I see it, but I don''t think it really is the focus of the photograph or add much to it.   On it''s own, outside of the challenge, it''s a nice shot...perhaps a bit tight in the crop at the top.  Some nice textures and good exposure in the different lighting areas of the photo.', '2007-03-31 02:48:03.000000', NULL, 0),
