(3566803, 415319, 66384, '<td valign="top">The background is a very nice complement for the flower. I like the depth of field. I see <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=15711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Jutilda</a> suggested using <a href="//www.neatimage.com/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Neat Image</a> to reduce the noise. Someone gave me that suggestion when I started at DPC, and using it has helped my scores. I don''t mind the noise in this image, but a lot of the DPC voters deduct points for noise.</td>', 'The background is a very nice complement for the flower. I like the depth of field. I see  Jutilda suggested using Neat Image to reduce the noise. Someone gave me that suggestion when I started at DPC, and using it has helped my scores. I don''t mind the noise in this image, but a lot of the DPC voters deduct points for noise.', '2007-04-20 18:53:50.000000', NULL, 0),
