(3788652, 416771, 49865, '<td valign="top">Stumbled upon this photo via the forums. If I had voted on this I would''ve given it probably an 8 or a 9. I feel like this captures the essence of bokeh far better than some other photo that scored higher. The range of colors in the background and the simplicity of the subject blowing in the wind really come together for me here.</td>', 'Stumbled upon this photo via the forums. If I had voted on this I would''ve given it probably an 8 or a 9. I feel like this captures the essence of bokeh far better than some other photo that scored higher. The range of colors in the background and the simplicity of the subject blowing in the wind really come together for me here.', '2007-06-15 16:05:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821076, 416888, 62787, '<td valign="top">Lepa perspektiva, odlican depth of field, mada mislim da bi mi se slika vise svidjala da nisi odsekao desnu stranu violine. Ali zanimljiva je - ima i muziku i nesto ljudsko u sebi.<br/> <br/>Grain mi se svidja - glasace na DPC-ju ionako ne treba shvatati previse ozbiljno :)</td>', 'Lepa perspektiva, odlican depth of field, mada mislim da bi mi se slika vise svidjala da nisi odsekao desnu stranu violine. Ali zanimljiva je - ima i muziku i nesto ljudsko u sebi. Grain mi se svidja - glasace na DPC-ju ionako ne treba shvatati previse ozbiljno :)', '2007-06-22 17:48:03.000000', NULL, 0),
